<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Iyyoba Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iyyoba Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Iyyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Iyyoba</para>
  <para style="mt1">Iyyoba Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyyoba maxaafan be7iya taarikey, daro waayenne metoy gakida issi xillo asa taarike. Iyyobinne iya laggeti he waayiya gaason bantaw si7etidaba ginxon qoncisida heedzu odata be7oos.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyyoba laggeti Iyyoba gakida metuwaba, benipe eriya banta ammanuwa wogan zempidi qofa immoosona. Hessa gisho, enti, “Xoossay xillo asas lo77oba immees; shin iita asi seerees. Iyyoba ha waaye ubbay gakiday, I nagara oothida gishosa” yaagosona. Iyyobi geeshshinne xillo asi gidida gisho, hessa mela seeri bessiya ase gidenna. Gidoshin, hessa mela waayey iya ayis gakidaako Iyyobi eranaw danda7ibeenna. Iyyoba ammanoy qaaxonna ixikoka, suure pirda immidi, bana la77a kessana melanne beni iya de7uwako zaarana mela, minthidi Xoosse woossis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Xoossay oychida oyshaas Iyyobi zaaro immanaw danda7onna ixikoka, iya ammano minotetha nashshidi, ba wolqaanne cincatetha malaalsiya ogen qoncisis. Hessafe guye, Iyyobi Xoossay gita gideysanne cinca gideysa eridi, minotethinne hanqoy kumida qaalata odetida gisho qiirotidi maarota oychis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wursethan Iyyobi beni de7uwako simmidaysanne iya aquwa kaseysafe dako darsidaysa odees. Iyyoba laggeti iya gakida metoy awura yidaako entaw geliboonna gisho, Xoossay enta bolla hanqetis. Meeze ammano qofape aathidi Xoossay gita gideysa eriday Iyyoba xalaala.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyoba gakida metuwanne waayiya <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JOB 1:10-2:13">1:10—2:13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyobanne Iyyoba laggeta oda <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JOB 3:1-31:40">3:1—31:40</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Koyro haasaya <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JOB 4:1-14:22">4:1—14:22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Nam7antho haasaya <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JOB 15:1-21:34">15:1—21:34</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Heedzantho haasaya <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JOB 22:1-31:40">22:1—31:40</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Elihu haasaya <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32:1—37:24</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossay Iyyobas zaaro immis <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JOB 38:1-42:6">38:1—42:6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossay Iyyoba zaaridi ubbaban anjis <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JOB 42:7-17">42:7-17</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Paacetetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1"/>Uxe biittan Iyyoba geetetiya issi asi de7ees; I borey bayna asi, suure asi, Xoosse yayyiyanne iitabaape haakida asi. <verse eid="JOB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2"/>Iyaw laapun adde naytinne heedzu macca nayti de7oosona. <verse eid="JOB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3"/>Iyaw laapun mukulu dorsati, heedzu mukulu gimaleti, ichashu xeetu waatha boorati, ichashu xeetu macca haretinne daro aylleti de7oosona. Doloha bagga biittan de7iya asa ubbaafe I aadhida dure asi.<verse eid="JOB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4"/>Iya adde nayti banta son son gibira giigisidi, banta heedzu micheta xeegidi issife moosonanne uyoosona. <verse eid="JOB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5"/>Gibira gallasati poletiya wode Iyyobi ba nayta xeegisidi, “Ooni eri ta nayti banta wozanan Xoosse baaddidi nagara oothonna aggokona” gidi wonta guura dendidi, entana geeshshanaw ba nayta issuwa issuwa sunthaa xeegidi xuussa yarsho yarshees. Iyyobi hessa ubba wode oothees.<verse eid="JOB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Koyro Paacetetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6"/>Issi gallas kiitanchoti Godaa sinthan bentanaw yidosona; Xalaheyka qassi entara yis. <verse eid="JOB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7"/>Goday Xalahiyako, “Neeni awupe yadii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Xalahey, “Taani sa7a ubban yaanne haanne yuuyashe gam7as” yaagidi zaaris.<verse eid="JOB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8"/>Goday Xalahiyako, “Yaatin, neeni ta aylliya Iyyoba loytha be7adii? Sa7a bolla iya mela borey bayna asi, suure asi, Xoosse yayyiyanne iitabaape haakida asi baawa” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9"/>Xalahey zaaridi, “Tuma Iyyobi Xoossas coo yayyii? <verse eid="JOB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10"/>Iyanne iya soo asaa, iyaw de7iyaba ubbaa neeni dirada naagabikii? I oothiya ooso ubbaa neeni anjida gisho iya mehe wudey biitta ubbaa bolla daris. <verse eid="JOB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11"/>Shin neeni ne kushiya yeddada, iyaw de7iya aquwa ubbaa shociyako, tuma I nena som7on baaddana” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12"/>Goday Xalahiyako, “Ero lo77o, iyaw de7iyaba ubbay ne kushena, shin iya bochofa” yaagis. Hessafe guye, Xalahey Godaa sinthafe keyidi bis.<verse eid="JOB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13"/>Issi gallas Iyyoba adde naytinne macca nayti banta bayra ishaa son moosonanne woyne ushshi uyoosona. <verse eid="JOB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14"/>Issi kiitetida asi Iyyobako yidi, “Nuuni boorata waaxidi goyishin, haretika nu matan mishin, <verse eid="JOB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15"/>Saaba biitta asati akeekona yidi ola kessidi, ubbaa bonqidi ekidosona; qassi aylletaka mashshan wodhidosona. Yaatin, taani ta xalaala attada ha hanidaba new odanaw yas” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16"/>I buroo odishin hara asi yidi, “Salope tami wodhidi dorsatanne heemmeyisata mis. Yaatin, taani ta xalaala attada ha hanidaba new odanaw yas” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17"/>I buroo odishin hara asi yidi, “Kaldaaweti heedzu cugan shaaketidi yidi, nuna olidi gimaleta ubbaa eki bidosona; aylletaka mashshan wodhidosona. Yaatin, taani ta xalaala attada ha hanidaba new odanaw yas” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18"/>I buroo odishin, hara asi yidi, “Ne adde naytinne macca nayti banta bayra ishaa son misheenne woyne ushshi uyishee de7ishin, <verse eid="JOB 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19"/>wolqaama gotey akeekona mela biittafe dendidi, keethaa shocin, keethay enta bolla kundidi nayta wodhis. Yaatin, taani ta xalaala attada ha hanidaba new odanaw yas” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20"/>Hessafe guye, Iyyobi dendidi, kayos ba ma7uwa pheedhis; ba huuphiya buluusis; biittan gufannidi goyinnishe,<verse eid="JOB 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21"/>“Taani ta aaye ulope kallo yeletas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">hayqasheka taani kallo baana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">Goday immis; Goday zaaridi ekis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">Godaa sunthay galatetto” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22"/>Ha ubbanka Iyyobi nagaraa oothibeenna; Xoossaa bolla iitaba odetibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Nam7antho Paacetetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1"/>Hara gallas kiitanchoti Godaa sinthan bentanaw yidosona; Xalaheyka qassi entara issife iya sinthan bentanaw yis. <verse eid="JOB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2"/>Goday Xalahiyako, “Neeni awupe yadii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:2">Xalahey Godaako, “Taani sa7a ubban yaanne haanne yuuyashe gam7as” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3"/>Goday Xalahiyako, “Neeni ta aylliya Iyyoba loythada be7adii? Sa7a bolla iya mela borey bayna asi, suure asi, Xoosse yayyiyanne iitabaape haakida asi baawa. Gaasoy bayna taani iya dhaysana mela ne tana denthethinka ha77i gakanaw I ba suuretethan minnidi eqis” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4"/>Xalahey zaaridi, “Ne shempoy atto” asi geysada asi ba shempuwa gisho baw de7iyaba ubbaa immees. <verse eid="JOB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5"/>Shin, “Neeni ne kushiya yeddada iya asatethaa bochiyako, I nena tuma som7on baaddana” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6"/>Goday Xalahiyako, “Ero lo77o, iya wodhopafe attishin, iya bolla ne koydaba oothanaw danda7aasa” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7"/>Hessafe guye, Xalahey Godaa sinthafe keyidi, Iyyoba tohope huuphe gakanaw iita madunthan kaa7etana mela oothis. <verse eid="JOB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8"/>Iyyobi bido bolla uttidi kon7an bana goodis.<verse eid="JOB 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9"/>Iya machiya, “Ha77i gakanawuka neeni ne suuretetha mintha oykadii? Xoossaa baaddada hayqaaga” yaagasu.<verse eid="JOB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10"/>Iyyobi zaaridi, “Neeni eeya maccasada waanada odetay? Nuuni Xoossaafe lo77oba eki gam7idi, iitabay gakiya wode ekokoyee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:10">Ha waaye ubban Iyyobi Xoossa bolla iitabaa odetibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Heedzu Iyyoba Laggeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11"/>Heedzu Iyyoba laggeti, Temaana biittafe Elfaazi, Shuuha biittafe Beldadoosinne Na7ima biitta asi gidida Soofari Iyyoba bolla gakida metuwa si7ida wode iyaw qadhetanawunne minthethanaw issife iyako yidosona. <verse eid="JOB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12"/>Enti iya haahon eqidi xeelliya wode I Iyyoba gideysa eribookona. Guyepe iya gideysa erida wode banta qaala dhoqu oothidi yeekidosona; banta ma7uwa peedhidi, banta huuphen baana qolidosona. <verse eid="JOB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13"/>Enti iyara laapun gallasinne laapun qamma biittan uttidosona. Enti iya waayey keehi daro gideysa be7ida gisho oonika iya odisibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1-2"/>Hessafe guye, Iyyobi ba doona dooyidi, ba yeletida gallasaa haysada yaagidi baaddis.<verse eid="JOB 3:1-2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3"/>“Taani qanthatida qammaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:3">yeletida gallasay baadetidaba gido!<verse eid="JOB 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4"/>He gallasay dhuman laameto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">Salo Xoossay he gallasaa qopofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">iya bolla poo7oyka poo7opo.<verse eid="JOB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5"/>Sakana dhuminne caagani iya goozo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">iya shaarii kammo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">iya poo7uwa dhumi qoso.<verse eid="JOB 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6"/>He gallasaa qamma sakana dhumi oyko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">Laytha giddon de7iya gallasatan taybetofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">ageenata taybonka gelopo.<verse eid="JOB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7"/>He qammay mayno;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">ufaysa ililsi iyan si7etofo.<verse eid="JOB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8"/>Leewataane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Leewataane: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Haathan de7iya wolqaama do7a.</char></note> denthanaw danda7eysatinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">gallasata baaddeysati he gallasaa baaddo.<verse eid="JOB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9"/>He qamman bakali poo7opo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">poo7o naagidi demmofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">wonta xalqey iyaw dolopo.<verse eid="JOB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10"/>He gallasay taani ta aaye ulon qanthatonna melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">ha waayiya be7onna mela ashshiboona gisho baadetidaysa gido.<verse eid="JOB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11"/>“Taani ta aaye ulon haatha gidida gidarkina!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">Ta aaye ulope yeleta wodhida mela hayqida gidarkina!<verse eid="JOB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12"/>Ta aayiya tana ayis ba ki7on ekadesha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">Ba dhanthaaka tana ayis dhanthadesha?<verse eid="JOB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13"/>He wode taani hayqidaba gidiyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">ha77i taani shempada dhiskana shin!<verse eid="JOB 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14"/>Ha77i laaletida bessata bantaw keexida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">ha sa7aa kawotaranne zoreysatara,<verse eid="JOB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15"/>enta keethan worqaynne biray kumida halaqatara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">issife duufon zin7anashin!<verse eid="JOB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16"/>Woyko bosha gididi yeletida na7ada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">gallasa poo7o be7iboona yooga na7ada biitta giddon ayis qosetabikina?<verse eid="JOB 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17"/>Duufon iitati banta iita ooso aggoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">yan daaburanchoti shempoosona.<verse eid="JOB 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18"/>He bessan qasho asati shempidi ufaytoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">enta un7etheyisata waasuwa yan si7okona.<verse eid="JOB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19"/>Gitinne guuthi yan de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">aylletika aylletethafe yan la77a keyoosona.<verse eid="JOB 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20"/>“Meton de7eysatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">shempoy cametidaysatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">poo7oy ayis imetidee?<verse eid="JOB 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21"/>Hayqo amotidi demmonaysatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">qottidi wothida shalope aathidi koyeysatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">de7oy ayis imetidee?<verse eid="JOB 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22"/>Duufo gakiya wode ufayteysatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">de7oy ayis imetidee?<verse eid="JOB 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23"/>Ogey dhayida uraas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">Xoossay iya yuushuwa dirida uraas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">poo7oy ayis imetidee?<verse eid="JOB 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24"/>Ooley taw kathi gidis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">ta waasoy goggiya haathi gidis.<verse eid="JOB 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25"/>Taani yayyidabay ta bolla gakis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">taani dagammidabay taw hanis.<verse eid="JOB 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26"/>Taw metope attishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">saroy, wopinne shempoy baawa” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Elfaaza Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1"/>Temaanape yida Elfaazi zaaridi,<verse eid="JOB 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2"/>“Issi asi xaltaamidi neera odetiko neeni lancanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">Shin haasayonna agganay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3"/>Heko, neeni darota tamaarsadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">argaacida kusheta minthethadasa.<verse eid="JOB 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4"/>Ne qaalay dhubetidaysata koolidi essis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">daaburida gulbatata minthis.<verse eid="JOB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5"/>Shin ha77i metoy nena gakin ufaysi qanxadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">un7i nena teqin dagammadasa.<verse eid="JOB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6"/>Ne Xoossaas yayyeysi nena ammanthidi wothibeennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">Ne suure hemethay new ufaysi gidibeennee?<verse eid="JOB 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7"/>“Ane qopa; geeshsha asi gididi dhayday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">Suure asi gididi shodetidi dhayday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8"/>Ta be7idaysada, iitatethi goyidi meto zereysati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">iya zaaridi buucana.<verse eid="JOB 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9"/>Enti Xoossaafe keya shempon punetidi dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">iya hanquwa lacuwan meetetana.<verse eid="JOB 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10"/>Iitati gudiya gaammo mela xaaggoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">shin enta achay meqeretis.<verse eid="JOB 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11"/>Shankatidi miyaba dhayida gaammoy hayqeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">enta naytika laaleteysada iitata nayti laaletana.<verse eid="JOB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12"/>“Issi gallas issi xuuray taako yis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">he xuura kalkashan ta si7as.<verse eid="JOB 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13"/>Wolqaama dhiskoy ase oykida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">un7ethiya qamma amuho giddon,<verse eid="JOB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14"/>yashshinne kokorsi tana oykis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">ta meqethati kokoridosona.<verse eid="JOB 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15"/>Carkoy ta som7uwa baqidi aadhis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">ta dagammin ta asatethaa ikisey eqis.<verse eid="JOB 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16"/>I ta sinthan eqis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">shin I aybeko shaakada erabike.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Hessafe guye, si77i gida bessafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">haysada giya girsaa si7as.<verse eid="JOB 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17"/>‘Hayqiya asi Xoossaa sinthan xillo gidanaw danda7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">Woyko asi bana medhidaysa sinthan geeshshi gidanaw danda7ii?<verse eid="JOB 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18"/>Xoossay ba aylletan ammanetonaba gidiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">ba kiitanchotanka bala demmiyaba gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19"/>Yaatin, urqa keethan de7eysati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">enta de7uwa baasoy biitta gididaysati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">guxunepe eeson hayqeysati waananee?<verse eid="JOB 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20"/>Wonta bentidi omarsi hayqoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">oonika hassayonna merinaw dhayoosona.<verse eid="JOB 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21"/>Dhishey shodetida dunkaane mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">cincatethi bayna hayqoosona.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1"/>“Iyyoba, new koyana asi de7iko ane xeega!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">Kiitanchotape oodeko ne xeellanee?”<verse eid="JOB 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2"/>Eeya uraa lancey wodhees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">akeeki bayna uraa qanaatey dhaysees.<verse eid="JOB 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3"/>Eeya uray minnidi de7ishin be7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">shin qoponna iya keethay baadetis.<verse eid="JOB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4"/>Iya nayti saroy bayna daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">pirda dabaaban entaw eqiya asi bayna gisho enti qohetana.<verse eid="JOB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5"/>I shiishida kathaa koshatida asay maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">hari attoshin aguntha giddon dolidaysaka aggokona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">Saamotidaysati iya shaluwa ekanaw amottoosona.<verse eid="JOB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6"/>Metoy sa7ape keyenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">waayey biittafe dolenna.<verse eid="JOB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7"/>Tami pinxidi wodheysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">asi metos yeletis.<verse eid="JOB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8"/>“Ta nena gidiyako ta Xoossako shiiqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">ta mootuwaka iya sinthan wothana.<verse eid="JOB 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9"/>I taybetonna malaatata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">pilgetonna wolqaamabata oothees.<verse eid="JOB 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10"/>Ira biittan bukisees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">goshsha gadiyas haathe yeddees.<verse eid="JOB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11"/>Kawushata dhoqu dhoqu oothees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">kayoteyisata minthethidi ufaysees.<verse eid="JOB 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12"/>Enta qofay poletonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">genanchota halchuwa hada oothees.<verse eid="JOB 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13"/>Cincata enta gene oosuwan oykees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">genanchota maquwa aathidi yeggees.<verse eid="JOB 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14"/>Gallasay entaw dhuma gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">seeta gallas dhuman hemetiya asada tattafana.<verse eid="JOB 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15"/>Manqota enta morketa mashshafe ashshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">enta wolqaamata kushiyape wothi ekees.<verse eid="JOB 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16"/>Hessa gisho, manqotas ufaysi de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">geellatethi si77i oothees.”<verse eid="JOB 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17"/>“Xoossay seeriya asi anjetidaysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">hessa gisho, Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaa seera kadhopa.<verse eid="JOB 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18"/>I menthees, shin zaaridi koolees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">I madunxisees, shin iya kushey dhallees.<verse eid="JOB 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19"/>Usupun qommo qohotape I nena ashshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">laapunthoy nena bochenna.<verse eid="JOB 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20"/>Kosha laythi hayqope,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">ola wode mashshafe nena ashshees.<verse eid="JOB 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21"/>I nena iita inxarsafe naagana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">boshi gakiya wode yayyaka.<verse eid="JOB 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22"/>Bosha bollanne kosha bolla ne miicana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">bazzo do7atas yayyaka.<verse eid="JOB 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23"/>Ne goshsha biittan shuchi deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">bazzo do7atara ne saron daana.<verse eid="JOB 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24"/>Ne dunkaaney saro gideysa ne erana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">ne daraa ne xomoosiya wode aybika pacenna.<verse eid="JOB 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25"/>Ne yeletay daranaysanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">ne kochay maata mela gidanaysa ne erana.<verse eid="JOB 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26"/>Kathi wode naagidi caketeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">neeni cimatethi kaallada duufo baana.<verse eid="JOB 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27"/>“Iyyoba, nuuni hessa ubbaa pilgidi xeellida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">Hessi tuma gidiya gisho akeekada eka” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1"/>Hessafe guye Iyyobi zaaridi,<verse eid="JOB 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2"/>Ta waayeynne ta azzanoy ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">mizaanen liketidi be7etiyako,<verse eid="JOB 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3"/>Abba gaxan de7iya shafiyape aadhidi deexana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">Hessa gisho, ta qaalay nena malaalsenashin.<verse eid="JOB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4"/>Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaa dongeti tana caddidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">ta asatethay enta yiishsha uyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">Xoossaa daganthoy ta bolla salpis.<verse eid="JOB 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5"/>Harey woyko boori maati de7ishin waassiyee?<verse eid="JOB 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6"/>Mal7onna kathi maxiney gelonna meetetiyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">Woyko phuuphulle haathi mal7iyee?<verse eid="JOB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7"/>Hessa mela kathi tana suukeyenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">hessa mela kathi ta miiko tana sakees.<verse eid="JOB 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8"/>Ta woosa Xoossi si7iyako aybee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">Ta amuwaka taw kunthiyako aybee?<verse eid="JOB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9"/>Xoossaa shene gidin I tana mentherethiyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">I ba kushiya yeddidi tana dhaysiyako,<verse eid="JOB 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10"/>Ta Geeshsha Xoossaa qaala kaddaboonna gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">waayey darikoka ufaysan ta gupana.<verse eid="JOB 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11"/>Ta paxa daanaw taw ayba wolqi de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">Taw ayba ufaysi de7ishin danda7iyana?<verse eid="JOB 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12"/>Ta wolqay shucha meleyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">Woyko ta ashoy naase birata meleyee?<verse eid="JOB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13"/>Taani tana maaddanaw ayba wolqi taw de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">maado demmanaw xeelliya bessika baawa.<verse eid="JOB 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14"/>Meton de7iya asi Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossas yayyeysa aggikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">iya laggeti iyaw keehatethi bessanaw koshshees.<verse eid="JOB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15"/>Shin ta ishati hinte iri bukonna wode meliya shaafa mela tana cimmeeta.<verse eid="JOB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16"/>Balgo ageenan ha shaafay shachan kumees.<verse eid="JOB 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17"/>Shin boney gakiya wode shachay til7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">shaafayka melees.<verse eid="JOB 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18"/>Caana mehe laaggishe biya zal7anchoti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">haathe koyanaw banta ogiyape gaxa keyidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">mela biittan toylatishe dhayoosona.<verse eid="JOB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19"/>Teema biitta zal7anchoti haathe koyoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">Saaba biitta oge asati ufaysi qanxokona.<verse eid="JOB 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20"/>Enti ammanetidi koyidi dhayida gisho yilotidosona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">he bessaa gakidi yeellatidosona.<verse eid="JOB 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21"/>Hinteka taw he shaafata mela gidideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">tana gakida metuwa be7idi yayyideta.<verse eid="JOB 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22"/>Hanoshin ta hintena, “Taw issiba immite”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">woyko, “Hinte shaluwara tana wozite” gadinaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23"/>“Tana ta morketa kushepe ashshite”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">woyko, “Qadhey bayna asaa kushepe tana wozite” gadinaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24"/>“Ta si77i gaana; hinte tana tamaarsite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">ta ay balidaako ane tana bessite.<verse eid="JOB 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25"/>Tuma odi cammikoka eketees!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">shin hinte oday aybiska maaddenna.<verse eid="JOB 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26"/>Hinte ta haasaya carko mela hada ootheeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">Yaatin, ufaysi qanxidaysas taw ay zaaro immanaw koyeetii?<verse eid="JOB 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27"/>Aawi bayna na7a bolla saama yeggeeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">hinte laggiya bayzanaw washiseeta.<verse eid="JOB 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28"/>Ane shama ayfen tana xeellite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:28">ta hinte sinthan wordotiyana?<verse eid="JOB 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29"/>Hayyana, ane zaarethidi qopite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">taani xillo ta bolla coo pirdofite.<verse eid="JOB 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30"/>Ta inxarsan wordoy de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">Ta doonay wordonne tumaa shaakanaw danda7ennee?”<verse eid="JOB 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1"/>Asa de7oy sa7a bolla wolqaama baaxe gidenneyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">Iya laythay une oothiya asa de7o mela gidenneyee?<verse eid="JOB 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2"/>Wulliya awa amotiya gaacha mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">woyko ba damooziya ekanaw naagiya oosanchoda,<verse eid="JOB 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3"/>hessada taw mela ageenati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">meto qammati imetidosona.<verse eid="JOB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4"/>Taani zin7iya wode awude barkandinasha gayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">Shin qammay taw aduqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">sa7i wontana gakanaw hiixan shireta shireta wodhayis.<verse eid="JOB 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5"/>Ta asatethay guxuntis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">ta madunthay giishshi goggees.<verse eid="JOB 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6"/>Ta laythay dorze mooqepe aadhidi ellesees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">ufaysi baynashin ta laythay wurees.<verse eid="JOB 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7"/>Abeeti Xoossaw, ta laythay issi shempo mela gideysa qopa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">Ta ayfey zaaridi keehaba be7enna.<verse eid="JOB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8"/>Ha77i be7ey zaaridi be7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">tana koyana shin zaari demmenna.<verse eid="JOB 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9"/>Shaari laaletidi dhayeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">duufo wodhiya asi simmidi keyenna.<verse eid="JOB 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10"/>Ba soo simmidi yeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">iya eriya asayka dogees.<verse eid="JOB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11"/>“Hessa gisho, ta si77i giike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">ta ayyaana un7etetha odana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">ta shempuwa cametethaa gisho zuuzumana.<verse eid="JOB 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12"/>Hessa mela neeni tana ayis naagay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">Ta new abba woyko abban de7iya iita do7a gadiyee?<verse eid="JOB 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13"/>‘Ta hiixay tana minthethana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">ta arsay tana zuuzunthafe shempisana!’ gada qopas;<verse eid="JOB 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14"/>Shin neeni tana amuhon yashisaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">qoncethan tana daganthaasa.<verse eid="JOB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15"/>Taani ha waayey kumida asatethaa tookada daanape,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">suletada hayqiyako dosayis.<verse eid="JOB 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16"/>Taani ta de7uwa shaatettas; daanaw koyke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">ta laythay issi shempo mela gidiya gisho tana aggarki.<verse eid="JOB 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17"/>Ne iya gitayada xeellanaw asi aybee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">Ne iyaw qopanaw asi aybee?<verse eid="JOB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18"/>Wonta wonta ne iya xomoosasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">woden woden ne iya paacasa.<verse eid="JOB 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19"/>Ne ta bolla ayfe wotheysa aggikii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">Cuchu mittiya wode taw immikii?<verse eid="JOB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20"/>Abeeti ase kaalleyso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">ta nagaraa oothin nena ay qohidee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Ne ayis tana cadda oykay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">New ta tooho gidadinaayee?<verse eid="JOB 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21"/>Ta naaquwa ayis aggikii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">Ta nagara ayis atto giikii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Ta duufo geliya wodey gakis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">ne tana koyana, shin hizape demmaka” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 7:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Baldadoosa Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1"/>Shuha biittafe yida Beldadoosi zaaridi,<verse eid="JOB 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2"/>“Neeni hessa awude gakanaw odetay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">Ne doonape keya qaalay wolqaama gote mela.<verse eid="JOB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3"/>Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay xillo pirdennee?<verse eid="JOB 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4"/>Ne nayti Xoossaa bolla nagaraa oothida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">I enta enta nagaraa gisho seeris.<verse eid="JOB 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5"/>Shin neeni Xoossaako simmiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaa woossiko,<verse eid="JOB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6"/>neeni geeshshinne suure gidiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">I ne gisho dendidi nena maaddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">I kase ne de7uwa zaaridi woytana.<verse eid="JOB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7"/>Ne doomethay guutha daanikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">ne wursethay daro aadhidi darana.<verse eid="JOB 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8"/>Kase yeletaa ane oycha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">nu mayzati ay tamaaridaako pilgada demma.<verse eid="JOB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9"/>Nuuni zine nayta aybaka eroko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">nu ha sa7an de7iya laythay kuya mela.<verse eid="JOB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10"/>Enti nena tamaarseynne new odey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">banta wozanan wothidabaape gidenneyee?<verse eid="JOB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11"/>Carey bayna bessan palki dolanaw danda7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">haathi bayna bessan mayrey cil7anaw danda7ii?<verse eid="JOB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12"/>Buroo diccidi qanxetonna de7ishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">cil7o maatapeka eeson melees.<verse eid="JOB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13"/>Xoossaa dogiya asaa ubbaa wursethay hessa mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">Xoosse eronna asaa ufaysay dhayana.<verse eid="JOB 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14"/>I ammanetiyabay meqiyaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">I ceeqetiyabayka shango haada mela.<verse eid="JOB 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15"/>I ba shango haada bolla zempana, shin eqenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">I iya oykana, shin duuxi wodhana.<verse eid="JOB 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16"/>I awa wode haathe uyidi cil7iya atakilte mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">ba xaphuwa biitta ubban yeddida mitha mela.<verse eid="JOB 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17"/>Ba xaphuwa keelan yeddees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">gita shucha bolla ba xaphuwa xaaxees.<verse eid="JOB 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18"/>Shin I ba bessaafe shodetiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">he bessay, ‘Ta nena be7abike’ yaagana.<verse eid="JOB 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19"/>Iita asata ufaysay hessa mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">harati yidi enta bessaa oykana.<verse eid="JOB 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20"/>“Xoossay borey bayna asaa yeggi aggenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">iita ootheyisata maaddenna.<verse eid="JOB 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21"/>I zaaridi nena miichananne ililsana.<verse eid="JOB 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22"/>Nena ixeysati yeella ma7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">iitata keethay dhayana” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1"/>Iyyobi zaaridi,<verse eid="JOB 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2"/>“Ee, hinte geysi tuma gideysa ta erayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">shin asi Xoossa sinthan waanidi xillo gidanaw danda7ii?<verse eid="JOB 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3"/>Iyara ooni palamanaw danda7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">I oychiya mukulu oyshatape issuwaka zaaranaw danda7enna.<verse eid="JOB 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4"/>Xoossay cincanne wolqaama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">iyara eqetanaw danda7ey oonika baawa.<verse eid="JOB 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5"/>Qoponna de7ishin dereta enta bessaafe diggees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">ba hanquwan aathidi yeggees.<verse eid="JOB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6"/>I biitta iya bessaafe qaathees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">biitta tuuqetaka yiggees.<verse eid="JOB 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7"/>Away keyonna mela oothees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">xoolintoti poo7onna mela diggees.<verse eid="JOB 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8"/>I barka salota miccis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">abba hobbiya bolla hemetees.<verse eid="JOB 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9"/>Xoossay Biire, Ooriyoona, Pilaadisa geetetiya xoolintotanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">dugeha baggara de7iya xoolinto koceeta medhis.<verse eid="JOB 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10"/>I asi pilgid eranaw danda7onna gitabata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">taybetonna malaalsiyabata oothees.<verse eid="JOB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11"/>I ta matara aadhiya wode ta be7anaw danda7ike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">I taako shiiqiya wode eranaw danda7ike.<verse eid="JOB 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12"/>I bonqiko digganaw danda7ey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">‘Waatay?’ yaagidi iya oychanay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13"/>Xoossay ba hanquwa teqenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">Ra7aaba geetetiya do7a maaddeysati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">iya tohuwa garsan kundoosona.<verse eid="JOB 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14"/>Yaatin, iya oysha zaaranaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">iyara mootetanaw taani oonee?<verse eid="JOB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15"/>Taani xillo gidikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">pirdiya Xoossay tana maaranaada woossanaape attishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">taani iyaw zaaro immike.<verse eid="JOB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16"/>Ta iya xeegin, I taw koyaakoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">tana si7ees gada ammanike.<verse eid="JOB 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17"/>Tana goten mentherethees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">gaasoy bayna ta madunthaa darsees.<verse eid="JOB 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18"/>Tana shempo diggees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">ta de7uwa camethees.<verse eid="JOB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19"/>Wolqaba gidiko, I wolqaama.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">Xillo pirdaba gidiko, iya pirda keethi shiishanay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20"/>Taani tana xillo giikoka ta doonay tana bala kessees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">tanan borey baawa ta giikoka ta inxarsay tana geella kessees.<verse eid="JOB 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21"/>Taani borey bayna asi gidikoka tabaa qopike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">taani ta de7uwa kadhayis.<verse eid="JOB 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22"/>Xoossay borey baynaysanne iita issife dhaysees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">ta dummatethi baawa gey hessa gishosa.<verse eid="JOB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23"/>Gadoy gelidi asaa qoponna wodhiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">I xillo asaa waayan miicees.<verse eid="JOB 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24"/>Ha sa7ay iita asaa kushen wodhiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">I pirdeyisata ayfiya goozees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:24">Hessa ubbaa oothey iya gidonna ixiko, hari oonee?<verse eid="JOB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25"/>Ta de7o laythati woxiya uraape aadhidi ellesoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">enti lo77oba be7onna piradhidi dhayoosona.<verse eid="JOB 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26"/>Ta de7o laythay palka wogoloda woxees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">arganthi miyaba oykanaw salope duge paalleysada paallees.<verse eid="JOB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27"/>‘Ta zuuzuntha dogana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">som7o tukeysa aggada poo7isana giyako,’<verse eid="JOB 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28"/>Neeni tana geeshshi goonnaysa taani eriya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">tana gakana waaye ubbaa taani yayyayis.<verse eid="JOB 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29"/>Yaatin, taani bala gideysi attonna ixiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">coo mela ayis daaburayna?<verse eid="JOB 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30"/>Taani ta asatethaa hari attoshin saamunan meecetiyakoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">ta kushiya dummabaara meecetiyakoka,<verse eid="JOB 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31"/>ta ma7oyka tana shaatettana gakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">neeni tana urqa ollan holana.<verse eid="JOB 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32"/>Ta iyaw zaaro immanaw Xoossay ta mela ase gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">gidiyako nu nam7ay daynna sinthan eqana.<verse eid="JOB 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33"/>Shin nu nam7aa bolla ba kushe wothidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">nuna sigethiya asi nu giddon de7eerenne!<verse eid="JOB 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34"/>Iya teemoy tana daganthonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">issi asi Xoossaa xam7aa taape digereneshin!<verse eid="JOB 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35"/>Yaaniko, taani iyaw yayyonna odetana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">shin ha77i taani danda7ike.<verse eid="JOB 9:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1"/>Tana duussi shaattis!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">Hessa gisho, ta zuuzumanaape attishin, si77i giike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">ta shempuwa seela kessana.<verse eid="JOB 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2"/>Taani Xoossaako haysada gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">ta bala taw odape attishin, ta bolla pirdofa.<verse eid="JOB 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3"/>Neeni iitata qofaa ufaysan ekashe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">tana un7ethanaw bessii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">ne kushen medhida uraa kadheysi wogee?<verse eid="JOB 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4"/>Ne ayfey asa ayfe meleyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">neeni asi xeelleysada xeellayee?<verse eid="JOB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5"/>Ne de7o laythay asa de7o laytha meleyee?<verse eid="JOB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6"/>Yaatin, ta bala ayis koyay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">Ta nagaraa ayis kaallay?<verse eid="JOB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7"/>Taani bala gidonaysanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">ne kushepe tana oonika ashshanaw danda7onnaysa ne eraasa.<verse eid="JOB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8"/>Tana ne kushey giigisidi medhis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">shin ha77i he kushey simmidi tana menthees.<verse eid="JOB 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9"/>Neeni tana biittafe medhidaysa hassaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">Yaatin, ha77i tana zaarada baana oothanaw koyay?<verse eid="JOB 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10"/>Tana maathada ta aaye ulon tigidaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">meqa maathada Irkisiday nena gidikii?<verse eid="JOB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11"/>Neeni tana ashonne goga mayzadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">shayaninne meqethan waaxadasa.<verse eid="JOB 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12"/>Neeni taw de7onne merinaa siiqo immadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">ne naagoy tana paxa wothis.<verse eid="JOB 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13"/>Shin neeni he wodepe doomada ne wozanan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">tana qohanaw qopada de7eysa ta erayis.<verse eid="JOB 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14"/>Ta naaquwa ne be7aasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">ta nagara oothiko seeronna aadhaka.<verse eid="JOB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15"/>Taani balikoka tana ayye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">Ta xillo gidikoka ceeqetanaw danda7ike.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">Ne tana yeella mayzadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">waayen wothadasa.<verse eid="JOB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16"/>Ta otoriko tana gaammoda shankatada oykaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">tana qohanaw ne malaalsiya wolqaa zaara zaara bessaasa.<verse eid="JOB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17"/>Neeni ta bolla ooratha markata ehaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">ne hanquwa ta bolla darsaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">tana olanaw ooratha olanchota giigisaasa.<verse eid="JOB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18"/>Yaatin, tana ta aaye ulope ayis kessadii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">Oonika tana be7onna hayqidaako taw lo77oshin!<verse eid="JOB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19"/>Taani medhetonna attidaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">woyko ta aaye ulope keyashe duufo gelidaako lo77oshin!<verse eid="JOB 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20"/>Ta guutha de7o laythay wurees gidenneyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">Ha guutha laythan ufaytana mela tana aggarki!<verse eid="JOB 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21"/>Ta simmonna bessaa boonna de7ishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">leelida dhuma biitta gakonna de7ishin,<verse eid="JOB 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22"/>iya poo7oy dhuma gidida bessaanne hayqoy kawotida bessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">maari bayna bessaanne leelida dhuma biitta boonna de7ishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">tana aggarki!”<verse eid="JOB 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Soofara Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1"/>Na7ima biittafe yida Soofari zaaridi,<verse eid="JOB 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2"/>“Ha hada haasaya ubbaas zaaro immiya asi baawee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">Woyko hessa odida uray tuma gidanaw danda7ii?<verse eid="JOB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3"/>Ne hada oday ase si77i oothiya daanii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">Ne qelqisiya wode nena seeriya asi baawee?<verse eid="JOB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4"/>Neeni, ‘Ta timirtey tuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">taani Xoossaa sinthan geeshshi’ ” gaasa.<verse eid="JOB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5"/>Xoossay new odiyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">ba doona dooyidi odetiyako aybe!<verse eid="JOB 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6"/>Cincatethas daro ogey de7iya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Xoossay new cincatetha xuura qoncisiyako aybe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:6">He wode ne seeretida seeray,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">besseysafe guutha gideysa eranashin.<verse eid="JOB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7"/>“Ciimmo gidida Xoossaa xuuraa eranaw danda7ay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">Woyko Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaba pilgada gakanaw danda7ay?<verse eid="JOB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8"/>Enti salotape dhoqa; ne ay oothanaw danda7ay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Enti Si7oolepeka aadhida ciimmo; ne eranaw danda7aka.<verse eid="JOB 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9"/>Xoossaa cincatethay biittafe dalgees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">abbafeka aadhidi ciimmotees.<verse eid="JOB 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10"/>I yidi nena qasho keethan yeggiyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">pirda keethi shiishiko, iya digganay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11"/>Xoossay pathonna asaa erees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">iitabaa be7iya wode si77i gidi aggenna.<verse eid="JOB 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12"/>Eeya asi cinca gideysafe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">wora harey ase gididi yeletanaysi mata.<verse eid="JOB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13"/>Neeni ne wozanaa suure oothiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">ne kushiya iyako micciko,<verse eid="JOB 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14"/>nagaraa ne kushepe haassiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">ne keethan iitabay doonna mela oothiko,<verse eid="JOB 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15"/>He wode neeni dhoqu gada yeelli bayna ubbaba be7an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">yashshi bayna minnada eqana.<verse eid="JOB 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16"/>Neeni ne metuwa ubbaa dogana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">goggidi aadhida di7oda zaara hassayaka.<verse eid="JOB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17"/>Ne de7oy seeta gallasa awape aadhidi poo7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">ne de7uwa dhumay wonta xalqeda poo7ana.<verse eid="JOB 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18"/>New ufaysi de7iya gisho neeni hirgonna daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">Xoossay nena naagiya gisho wopu gada daana.<verse eid="JOB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19"/>Neeni yashshi bayna dhiskana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">daro asay nenan nashetanaw koyana.<verse eid="JOB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20"/>Shin iitati meto be7ishe akeekokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">iyape baqatidi attanaw danda7okona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">Enta ufaysay hayqo” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 11:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1"/>Iyyobi haysada yaagidi zaaris.<verse eid="JOB 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2"/>Ee, hinte tumaka ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">cincatethi hintera hayqana!<verse eid="JOB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3"/>Shin taka hinteda akeeki de7iya asi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">taani hintefe guuxike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">Ha hinte odetidaba eronnay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4"/>Taani Xoossaa woossin I tana si7ida asi gidikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">ha77i ta laggetas miichas attas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">taani xillonne borey bayna asi gidikoka qelqisethas attas.<verse eid="JOB 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5"/>Metootidi be7iboona asi hara asa meton miicees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">hinte kundanaw gandigariya asi sugeeta.<verse eid="JOB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6"/>Bonqeyisata keethay saro de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">Xoossaa yiloyeysati hirgi bayna de7oosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">banta wolqaa bantaw xoosse oothosona.<verse eid="JOB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7"/>Ane meheta oycha; enti nena tamaarsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">Woyko salo kafota oycha; enti new odana.<verse eid="JOB 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8"/>Woyko sa7a medhetethatas oda; enti nena tamaarsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">abba molotika new odana.<verse eid="JOB 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9"/>Godaa kushey hessa oothidaysa eronnay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10"/>De7oy de7iya medhetethi ubbaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">asa shempoy iya kushena.<verse eid="JOB 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11"/>Inxarsi kathi shaakidi ereysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">haythi oda shaakidi erenneyee?<verse eid="JOB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12"/>Cincatethi dondzida asaa matan deneyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">daro laythi de7ida asaa matan akeeki benteneyee?<verse eid="JOB 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13"/>Cincatethinne wolqi Xoossasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">zoreynne akeeki iya matan bentees.<verse eid="JOB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14"/>Xoossay laallidaba zaari keexanay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">I qachida uraa birshanay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15"/>Xoossay ira teqiko biittay melees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">ira bukisiko di7oy biitta dhaysees.<verse eid="JOB 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16"/>Minotethinne xoonoy Xoossasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">cimeteysinne cimmeysi nam7ayka iyape garsan de7ees.<verse eid="JOB 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17"/>Zoreysatape cincatethaa qaari ekees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">halaqataka eeya kessees.<verse eid="JOB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18"/>I kawota araatape wothidi aylle kessees.<verse eid="JOB 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19"/>Kahinetape bonchuwa qaari ekees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">adussa wode xapho yeddida wolqaamata shiri yeggees.<verse eid="JOB 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20"/>Ammanetida zoreyisata si77i oothees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">cimatapeka akeeka yegisees.<verse eid="JOB 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21"/>Bonchetidaysata kawushshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">minota danco bilisees.<verse eid="JOB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22"/>Dhuman de7iya xuura qonce kessees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">leelida dhumaa poo7o kessees.<verse eid="JOB 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23"/>Xoossay kawotethata gitayees; zaaridi dhaysees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">Kawotethata dalgisees; zaaridi laallees.<verse eid="JOB 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24"/>Alamiya kawota akeeka diggees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">ogey bayna mela biittan toylatana mela oothees.<verse eid="JOB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25"/>Poo7oy bayna dhuman tattafoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">mathotida asada gandigaroosona.<verse eid="JOB 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1"/>Ha ubbaa ta ayfey be7is;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">ta haythay si7idi akeekis.<verse eid="JOB 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2"/>Hinte ereysa taka erayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">taani hintefe guuxike.<verse eid="JOB 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3"/>Shin taani Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossara odetanaw koyayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">taani ta metuwaba iyara mootetanaw amottayis.<verse eid="JOB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4"/>Shin hinte wordon kammeyisata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">hinte ubbayka pathonna aakimeta.<verse eid="JOB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5"/>Hinte si77i gidaba gidiyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">cinca gidi bentanashin!<verse eid="JOB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6"/>Ha77i ta mootuwa si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">ta doonape keya palama hayzite.<verse eid="JOB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7"/>Hinte Xoossaa gisho wordo odeteetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">Iya gisho gidi cimon odeteetii?<verse eid="JOB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8"/>Hinte iya maaddiyabay de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">Woyko iyaw xabaqa eqidi mootetetii?<verse eid="JOB 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9"/>I hintena pilgi xeelliyako hintefe lo77oba demmanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Hinte ase cimmeysada iya cimmanaw danda7eetii?<verse eid="JOB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10"/>Hinte geeman asa som7o be7idi maaddiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">I tuma hintena seerana.<verse eid="JOB 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11"/>Iya bonchoy hintena daganthennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">Iya teemay hintena yashshennee?<verse eid="JOB 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12"/>Hinte odida leemisoy bidintha mela pathonnaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">hinte mootoy biittafe medhetida gondalle mela.<verse eid="JOB 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13"/>Ane si77i giite; ta odetana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">hizape hanidabay hano.<verse eid="JOB 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14"/>Taani tanatethaa ayis meton yeggiyana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">Ta de7uwa ayis ta kushen oykiyana?<verse eid="JOB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15"/>Xoossay tana wodhikoka taani iya danda7an naagana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">taani ta metuwa iya sinthe shiishana.<verse eid="JOB 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16"/>Nagarancho asi iya sinthe shiiqanaw danda7onna gisho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">ooni eri ta xaalatethay atotethas gaaso gidanaw danda7ees.<verse eid="JOB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17"/>Ta haasaya akeekidi si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">ta oday hinte haythan gelo.<verse eid="JOB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18"/>Ha77i taani ta metuwa eka shiiqas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">I taw pirdanaysa erayis.<verse eid="JOB 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19"/>Tana mootana asi de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">De7iko taani si77i gada hayqana.<verse eid="JOB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20"/>Xoossaw ne taw ha nam7ubata ootha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">yaatiko ta ne sinthafe geemmike.<verse eid="JOB 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21"/>Ne seera kushiya taape dentha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">tana dagantheysa agga.<verse eid="JOB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22"/>Hessafe guye, tana xeega; ta koyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">Woyko ta odana, ne taw zaara.<verse eid="JOB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23"/>Ta balaynne nagaray aapunee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">Ane ta naaquwanne ta nagaraa tana bessa.<verse eid="JOB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24"/>Neeni ayis ne som7uwa taape genthay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">ne morkeda ayis tana taybay?<verse eid="JOB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25"/>Carkoy efiya kaliya ayis un7ethay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">melida punuwa ayis yedethay?<verse eid="JOB 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26"/>Neeni ta bolla xaafida mootoy camo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">ta na7atetha balaka aggabaaka.<verse eid="JOB 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27"/>Neeni ta tohuwa duxadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ta tanguwa ubbaa wochaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ta tohoy yedhiyasuwa kaallasa.<verse eid="JOB 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28"/>Hessa gisho, taani wooqida mithada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">bili mida afilada wurayis.<verse eid="JOB 13:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1"/>“Maccasape yeletida asas laythi qanthi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">ika qassi meton kumis.<verse eid="JOB 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2"/>Ciishshada bentidi ellesidi qoqofetees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">kuyada gam7onna eeson aadhees.<verse eid="JOB 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3"/>Yaatin, neeni hessa mela asi kaallayee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">pirdas ne sinthe shiishayee?<verse eid="JOB 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4"/>Tunabaape geeshshaba kessanaw danda7ey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">Oonika baawa.<verse eid="JOB 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5"/>Asi daana laythas zawi de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">I daana ageena neeni tayba wothadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">neeni wothida zawape aadhey oonika baawa.<verse eid="JOB 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6"/>Une oothiya asi ba oosuwa polidi shempeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">I shempana mela ne ayfiya iyape denthada iya aggaaga.<verse eid="JOB 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7"/>Qanxetida mithas ufaysi de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">zaaridi aacees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">ooratha tashe kessidi diccees.<verse eid="JOB 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8"/>Mithaa xaphoy biitta garsan cimikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">durumay biittan wooqikoka,<verse eid="JOB 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9"/>haathe demmidi aacees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">ooratha dolada tashe kessees.<verse eid="JOB 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10"/>Shin asi hayqees; hessi iyaw wursethi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">iya shempoy keyape guye I awun de7ii?<verse eid="JOB 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11"/>Abbaa haathi meleysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11">shaafa haathi wureysada,<verse eid="JOB 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12"/>hessada asika hayqees; simmidi dendenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">saloti aadhana gakanaw asi baarkenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">ba dhiskuwafeka dendenna.<verse eid="JOB 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13"/>Neeni tana duufon genthidaako aybe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">Ne hanqoy aadhana gakanaw qottidaako aybe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">Ne taw qamida he gallas tana hassaydaako aybe!<verse eid="JOB 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14"/>Asi hayqiko simmidi de7on daanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">Ta shempiya wodey yaana gakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">ha meto wode ubbaa danda7an naagana.<verse eid="JOB 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15"/>He wode ne tana xeegana taka koyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">ne medhida tana be7anaw laamotiya wodey yaana.<verse eid="JOB 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16"/>He wode neeni tuma ta tanguwa wochana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">shin ta nagaraa kaallaka.<verse eid="JOB 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17"/>Ta balay ogoron yiicetana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">ta nagaraa neeni kammana.<verse eid="JOB 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18"/>Zumi woddeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">zaalli dhoqalleteysada,<verse eid="JOB 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19"/>haathi shucha xapho bookeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">di7oy biitta meeccidi efeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">neeni asa ufaysi dhaysaasa.<verse eid="JOB 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20"/>Neeni iya merinaw xoonasa; I simmenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">iya malaa laammada ne sinthafe diggaasa.<verse eid="JOB 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21"/>Iya nayti bonchetiko I erenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">enti kawuyiko I be7enna.<verse eid="JOB 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22"/>Shin iya asatethaa seelay iya xalaalas si7etees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">I ba xalaalas yeekees” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Elfaaza Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1"/>Temaana biittafe yida Elfaazi haysada yaagis;<verse eid="JOB 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2"/>“Cinca asi carkoda oyketonnaba odeetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">Woyko doloha bagga carkuwan ba uluwa coo kunthii?<verse eid="JOB 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3"/>Pathonna qaalan zuuzumii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">Woyko gatey bayna odan mootetii?<verse eid="JOB 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4"/>Neeni Xoossas yayyeysa aggadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">harati Xoossaa goyinnona mela dhubbadasa.<verse eid="JOB 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5"/>Ne iitatethay ne odan eretees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">shin ne cinca oday nena genthees.<verse eid="JOB 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6"/>Ne doonay ne bolla pirdees tana gidike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">ne inxarsay ne bolla markatees.<verse eid="JOB 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7"/>“Asape koyro yeletiday nenee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">Neeni dereti medhetanaape kase yeletadii?<verse eid="JOB 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8"/>Neeni Xoossaa xuura duulatan de7ay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">asa cincatethi ne xalaalas de7iyee?<verse eid="JOB 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9"/>Nuuni eronnabay neeni eriyabay aybee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">Nuus geemmidi new qoncida ayba cincatethi de7ii?<verse eid="JOB 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10"/>Ne aawape bayratiya asati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">cimidi puulumida asati nuura de7oosona.<verse eid="JOB 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11"/>“Xoossay new immida minthethoy gidenneyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">nuuni kahaamatethaba odida qaalay guutheyee?<verse eid="JOB 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12"/>Ne wozanay nena ayis wora efii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">Ne ayfey ayis dereeqidi xeellii?<verse eid="JOB 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13"/>Yaatada neeni Xoossaa bolla hanqetadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">iita qaala ne doonape kessadasa.<verse eid="JOB 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14"/>Asi Xoossa sinthan geeshshi gidanaw danda7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">Woyko maccafe yeletida asi xillo gidanaw danda7ii?<verse eid="JOB 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15"/>Xoossay ba kiitanchotan ammanetena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">hari attoshin saloti iya sinthan geeshshi gidokona.<verse eid="JOB 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16"/>Iitanne tuna gidida asi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">nagara haathada uyaa asi waanidi ammanetanee?<verse eid="JOB 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17"/>“Ane si7a, qoncisada ta new odana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17">taani be7idaba ubbaa new odana.<verse eid="JOB 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18"/>Cincati banta aawatape ekidaysa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">ta new genthonna odana.<verse eid="JOB 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19"/>Biittay enta xalaalas imetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">hara biitta asi entara walaketibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20"/>Ase un7ethishe de7iya iita asi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">ba de7o laytha ubban waayetishe de7ees.<verse eid="JOB 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21"/>Daganthiyabay iya haythan si7etees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">I saro de7ayis gishin dhayseysati iya bolla keyana.<verse eid="JOB 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22"/>Dhumape kessi ekoy iyaw hanenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">iya qaaday mashshan dhayo.<verse eid="JOB 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23"/>Iya ahay anko quma gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">baw dhuma gallas matatidaysa I erees.<verse eid="JOB 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24"/>Metoynne un7i iya bolla yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">olanaw keyida kawo mela iya bolla goobana.<verse eid="JOB 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25"/>Hessika I ba kushiya Xoossaa bolla denthida gishosa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaa bolla xaalida gishosa.<verse eid="JOB 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26"/>I eqetanaw minonne dalga gondalle oykis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">otoron Xoossaako hordofees.<verse eid="JOB 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27"/>“Iya kilahoy muumida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">iya xeessay kumida gisho,<verse eid="JOB 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28"/>I laaletida katamatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">kaysa keethaninne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">kundanaw gakida keethan de7ees.<verse eid="JOB 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29"/>I ba duretethan daro gam7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">iya zaway aakenna.<verse eid="JOB 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30"/>Dhumape kessi ekenaw danda7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">tashiya tami labida mithadanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">carkoy ciishsha qoqofida mithada gidana.<verse eid="JOB 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31"/>Pathonnaban ammanetidi bana cimmofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">iyape aykoka demmonna attana.<verse eid="JOB 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32"/>Wodey gakonna iya ubbay melidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">tasheyka aaconna mitha mela gidana.<verse eid="JOB 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33"/>I teeronna qawu7e de7ishe qoqofetiya woyne mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">ciishshan de7ishe qoqofetiya shamaho mela.<verse eid="JOB 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34"/>Xoossas yayyonna asaa kochay dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">wodhaafen keexetida keethay taman meetetana.<verse eid="JOB 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35"/>Enti iitatethi qanthatidi meto yeloosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">enta uluwan geney kumis” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1"/>Iyyobi haysada yaagidi zaaris;<verse eid="JOB 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2"/>“Taani hessa mela haasaya daro si7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">hinte minthethoy tana salethis.<verse eid="JOB 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3"/>Go77i bayna hinte odaas wursethi baawee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">taara hintena hessada palanthiya gaasoy aybee?<verse eid="JOB 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4"/>Hinte ta bessan, taani hinte bessan gididaba gidiyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">taani ta huuphiya qaathashe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">ha77i hinte giyaba ubbaa hinte bolla loythada gaanashin!<verse eid="JOB 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5"/>Ta zoriyan ta hintena minthethanashin!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">Ta doonape keyiya oday hintena minthethanashin!<verse eid="JOB 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6"/>“Shin ta haasaykoka ta sahoy decenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">ta si77i gada danda7ikoka taape kichenna.<verse eid="JOB 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7"/>Abeeti Xoossaw, ne tana ta asatethafe kessadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">ta keethaa asa ubbaa dhaysadasa.<verse eid="JOB 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8"/>Shuuqida ta gogay taw marka gidis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">ta gilqatethay tana nagarancho kessis.<verse eid="JOB 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9"/>Xoossay hanqetidi ta asatethaa qanxerethis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">tana ixidi ba acha ta bolla garcis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">ta morkey ba ayfiya ta bolla kessis.<verse eid="JOB 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10"/>Asay ta yuushon shiiqidi tana qelqisidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">tana leqidi baqidosona. <verse eid="JOB 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11"/>Xoossay tana nagarachotas aathidi immis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">iitata kushen tana yeggis.<verse eid="JOB 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12"/>Taani kase saro de7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">shin Xoossay tana tincherethis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">ta mirgaciya oykidi tana mentherethis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">cache loohisiya malla oothis.<verse eid="JOB 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13"/>Iya tooranchoti banta dongen tana teqidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">qadhey bayna ta kilahuwa muxerethidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">ta ciyaa sa7an gussidosona.<verse eid="JOB 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14"/>I tana zaari zaari madunxisis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">olanchoda toollidi caddis.<verse eid="JOB 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15"/>Taani kayo ma7o ma7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">ta wolqay wurin baanan uttas.<verse eid="JOB 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16"/>Yeehon ta som7oy gabbis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">ta ayfey zo77is.<verse eid="JOB 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17"/>Shin he ubban ta balidabay baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">ta geeshsha wozanan woossayis.<verse eid="JOB 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18"/>Biittaw, tana gakida qohuwa kammofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">ta waasoy shempiya soo demmofo.<verse eid="JOB 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19"/>Heko ta markay salona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">ta xabaqay bollana.<verse eid="JOB 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20"/>Ta laggeti tana kadhidi xeelloosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">ta ayfey Xoossa sinthan afuthi tigees.<verse eid="JOB 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21"/>Ase asara sigethiya asi de7eysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">tana Xoossara sigethiya asi de7idaba gidernishin.<verse eid="JOB 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22"/>Ta laythay wurana hanees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">guutha wodepe guye ta simmonna soo baana.<verse eid="JOB 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1"/>Ta shempoy keyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">ta laythay qaammis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">taw duufoy giigis.<verse eid="JOB 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2"/>Ta bolla qelqiseysati ta yuushuwan de7oosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">enti tana yiloyida mela aysidosona.<verse eid="JOB 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3"/>Abeeti Xoossaw, neepe hari tana maaddey bayna gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">ne taw waase gida.<verse eid="JOB 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4"/>Enti akeekona mela enta qofaa gordadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">Hessa gisho, ne entaw xoono immofa.<verse eid="JOB 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5"/>Miishe demmana gidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">ba laggeta aathidi immiya uraa nayta ayfey qooqana.<verse eid="JOB 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6"/>Xoossay tana asas miichas aggis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">asi cuttishe aadhiya asi gidas.<verse eid="JOB 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7"/>Ta daro kayotida gisho ta ayfey eeyis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">ta asatethay laafidi eesho gidis.<verse eid="JOB 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8"/>Keeha asati tana be7idi dagammidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">suureti Xoossaa ammanonayisata bolla yilotidosona.<verse eid="JOB 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9"/>Gidoshin xilloti banta ogiyape deshokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">suureti wolqa guji guji boosona.<verse eid="JOB 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10"/>Shin zaaridi ubbay taako haa yiite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">ta hinte giddofe issi cinca asi demmike.<verse eid="JOB 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11"/>Ta de7o laythay wuris;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">ta halchoy hada gidis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">ta wozanaa amoy coo attis.<verse eid="JOB 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12"/>Ta laggeti qamma gallas goosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">dhuma be7ishe ‘Poo7ana hanees’ yaagosona.<verse eid="JOB 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13"/>Ta ufaysan naagiya keethay duufo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">ta hiixa dhuman hiixayis.<verse eid="JOB 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14"/>Duufoko, ‘Ne ta aawa’ yaagana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">guxuneko, ‘Ne ta aayo woyko ta micho’ yaagana.<verse eid="JOB 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15"/>Yaatin, taw ay ufaysi de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">taw ufaysi gidiyaba ooni demmanay?<verse eid="JOB 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16"/>Ta ufaysay taara duufo bandee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">Nu issife biittan duge gelanee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Baldadoosa Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1"/>Hessafe guye, Shuuha biittafe yida Beldadoosi zaaridi,<verse eid="JOB 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2"/>“Iyyoba, ne odaas wursethi baawee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">Ane akeeka; nu odiyaba si7a.<verse eid="JOB 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3"/>Ne nuna ayis miizi oothay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">Ayis nuna tulle kessay?<verse eid="JOB 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4"/>Ne hanqetada nena qohaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">Ne hanquwan biittay kallo attanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">Woyko zaallay ba bessaafe qaaxennee?<verse eid="JOB 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5"/>Nagaranchota xompey to7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">iya tama lacoy dhayana.<verse eid="JOB 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6"/>Enta keethan de7iya xompey dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">enta poo7oyka dhumana.<verse eid="JOB 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7"/>I tangiya tangoy qaammees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">iya iita qofay iya zaaridi mees.<verse eid="JOB 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8"/>Iya hemethay iya xihen gelsees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:8">iya tohoti gitetana.<verse eid="JOB 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9"/>Xihey iya ginde oykana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">diizi iya qaaxo diggana.<verse eid="JOB 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10"/>Yurde wodoroy sa7an iyaw geemmi uttees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">I hemetiya ogiyan gitey de7ees.<verse eid="JOB 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11"/>Dagami iya teqidi oykees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">iya guyera kaallidi iya yedethees.<verse eid="JOB 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12"/>Iya wolqaa koshi wursis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">dhayoy iya miyen naagees.<verse eid="JOB 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13"/>Hargey iya laafethees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">hayqoy iya mokidi ekees.<verse eid="JOB 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14"/>Hirgi bayna de7iya ba keethaafe goodetees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">enti iya hayqo geetetiya kawako efoosona.<verse eid="JOB 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15"/>Iya keethay taman oyketana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">I de7iyasuwan diinney laaletana.<verse eid="JOB 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16"/>Garsara xaphoy melana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">bollara haythi qoqofetana.<verse eid="JOB 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17"/>Iya qopiya asi biittafe dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">iya sunthay sa7an hassayetonna attana.<verse eid="JOB 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18"/>I poo7ope dhuman goodettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">alamiyape dhayana.<verse eid="JOB 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19"/>Iyaw na7i woyko kochi dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">I de7ida bessan issi asi paxa attenna.<verse eid="JOB 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20"/>Wuloha bagga asay, iya gakida metuwan dagammidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">doloha bagga asay yashshan kokoridosona.<verse eid="JOB 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21"/>Iita asaa wursethay awudeka hessa mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">Xoossaa eronna asaa qaaday hessa mela” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 18:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Haasaya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1"/>Iyyobi zaaridi haysada yaagis;<verse eid="JOB 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2"/>Hinte tana awude gakanaw madunxiseetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">Awude gakanaw hinte qaalan tana caddetii?<verse eid="JOB 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3"/>Hinte tana tammu toho cayideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">tana kawushishe yeellateketa.<verse eid="JOB 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4"/>Tuma ta balidaba gidiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">ta balay tana oychana.<verse eid="JOB 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5"/>Hinte hintena dhoqu dhoqu oothidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">ta kawusha tana mootanaw go7etiko,<verse eid="JOB 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6"/>ha metuwa ta bolla ehiday Xoosse gideysanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">ba gitiyan tana gelsiday iya gideysa erite.<verse eid="JOB 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7"/>Ta qohetas gada waassin, tana alley baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">ta qaala dhoqu oothada waassinka tana si7ey baawa.<verse eid="JOB 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8"/>Ta kanthada boonnada Xoossay ta ogiya diris;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">ta hemetiya ogiya dhuman gordis.<verse eid="JOB 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9"/>Ta bonchuwa taape qaaris;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">ta kallachaa ta huuphepe ekis.<verse eid="JOB 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10"/>I tana mentherethi yeggis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">ta ufaysa xaphora shodetida mitha mela oothis.<verse eid="JOB 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11"/>Iya hanqoy ta bolla eexi keyis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">I tana morkeda taybees.<verse eid="JOB 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12"/>Tana olanaw ba tooranchota kiittees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">enti tana olanaw miixa keexidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">ta dunkaaniya yuushuwan uttidosona.<verse eid="JOB 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13"/>Xoossay ta ishata taape haassis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">tana ereysati taw allaga gididosona.<verse eid="JOB 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14"/>Ta dabboti taape haakidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">ta laggeti tana dogidosona.<verse eid="JOB 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15"/>Ta son moketiya imathati tana dogidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">ta macca aylleti tana oge asada xeellidosona.<verse eid="JOB 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16"/>Ta aylliya ta xeegin taw koyenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">ta woossin taw ero geenna.<verse eid="JOB 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17"/>Ta machiya ta doona peenuwa shaatetasu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">ta ishati tana uufidosona.<verse eid="JOB 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18"/>Hari attoshin guutha nayti tana kadhoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">tana be7idi leqoosona.<verse eid="JOB 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19"/>Ta mata laggeti ubbay tana uufosoona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">ta doseysati taw zoko zaaridosona.<verse eid="JOB 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20"/>Ta meqethay ta gogaara oyketis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">taani hayqa kichada attas.<verse eid="JOB 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21"/>Ta laggeto, Xoossaa kushey tana dechida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">taw qadheterketi.<verse eid="JOB 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22"/>Xoossay tana yedetheysada, hinte tana ayis yedetheetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">ha77i gakanaw hinte tana waaysidaysi gidennee?<verse eid="JOB 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23"/>“Ha77i gakanaw ta odetida qaalay mazgabetidaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">maxaafan xaafetidaako ta dosayis shin.<verse eid="JOB 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24"/>Merinaw daana mela maarisaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">irsaasen zaalla bolla woocetidi xaafetida gideerenne!<verse eid="JOB 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25"/>Tana Wozidaysi de7on de7eysanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">wursethan biitta bolla I eqanaysa ta erayis.<verse eid="JOB 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26"/>Ta gogay meetetidi wurikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">taani ta ashuwape shaaketada Xoossaa be7anaysa erayis. <verse eid="JOB 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27"/>Hara asi gidonna taani ta huuphen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">ta ayfen iya be7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">ta wozanay he qamma laamotees.<verse eid="JOB 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28"/>“Ha metuwas gaasoy iya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">nu iya waati yedethino gidi hinte qopiya gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29"/>Mashshas yayyite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">Xoossa hanqoy mashshara yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">pirdi de7eysa erite” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Soofara Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1"/>Na7ima biitta asi gidida Soofari haysada yaagidi zaaris;<verse eid="JOB 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2"/>“Ne oday tana lancisida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">ta ellesada ne odaas zaaro immana.<verse eid="JOB 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3"/>Ne oday ta bonchuwa qaariya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">ta akeekay new zaaro immana mela tana denthethees.<verse eid="JOB 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4"/>Asi biitta bolla de7ida wodepe doomidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">benipe hanidaba eraasa.<verse eid="JOB 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5"/>Iita asa ceeqoy qantha wodesa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">Xoossaa eronna asaa ufaysay guutha wodesa.<verse eid="JOB 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6"/>Iita asa otoroy salo gakanaw dhoqu giikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">iya huuphey shaara gakidi bochikoka,<verse eid="JOB 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7"/>I baana mela pitetidi dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">Iya kase eriya asay ‘I awun de7ii?’ yaagana.<verse eid="JOB 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8"/>Elmoda paallidi dhayana; simmidi bentenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">qamma amuhoda coo dhayana.<verse eid="JOB 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9"/>Iya kase be7ida ayfeti zaaridi iya be7okona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">I ba de7iya bessaafe tim7i gidi dhayana.<verse eid="JOB 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10"/>Aaway bonqi ekida miishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">iya nayti banta kushen guye zaarana.<verse eid="JOB 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11"/>Iya meqethaa kumida na7atetha wolqay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">iyara issife biittan zin7ana.<verse eid="JOB 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12"/>“Iitatethi iya doonan mal7iko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">I ba inxarsaafe garsan qosiko,<verse eid="JOB 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13"/>wuronnaada ba doonan oykidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">wothi aggiko,<verse eid="JOB 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14"/>iya uluwan camo gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">wodhiya shoosha marze gidana.<verse eid="JOB 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15"/>Iita asi mitida shaluwa zaari cuttana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">iya uluwan de7iya ubbaa Xoossay cooshshana.<verse eid="JOB 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16"/>Iita asi miyabay iyaw marze gididi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">iya wodhana.<verse eid="JOB 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17"/>Eessinne maathi haathada goggishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">I be7onna attana.<verse eid="JOB 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18"/>Ba daabura ayfiya moonna haras immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">zal7idi wodhisida wodhiyan ufaytenna.<verse eid="JOB 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19"/>Hessi haniday I manqota un7ethida gishonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">hara asi keexida keethaa bonqida gishosa.<verse eid="JOB 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20"/>“Iya iita amoy shempo diggis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">shiishida shaloy iya ashshanaw danda7enna.<verse eid="JOB 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21"/>Iya shaloy wuriya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">iya duretethay gam7enna.<verse eid="JOB 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22"/>Iyaw aqoy kumidi de7ishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">metoy akeekona iya bolla gaki wodhana.<verse eid="JOB 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23"/>Iya uloy kaalliya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">Xoossay wolqaama hanquwa iya bolla gussana.<verse eid="JOB 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24"/>Birata mashshafe I baqatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">shin naase birata dongey iya caddana.<verse eid="JOB 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25"/>He dongey iya zokora kanthi keyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">phooliya xeeray iya tiriya kanthi aadhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">dagami iya wozanaa waabaqisana.<verse eid="JOB 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26"/>I shiishida aqoy sakana dhuman dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">asi oythiboonna tami iya maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">iya keethan attida shalo ubbaa xuuggana.<verse eid="JOB 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27"/>Saloti iya nagaraa qoncisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">sa7ika iyaw morke gidana.<verse eid="JOB 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28"/>Xoossaa hanqo gallasan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">iya keethaanne iyaw de7iyaba di7oy efana.<verse eid="JOB 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29"/>Xoossay geellatas wothida qaaday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">iita asaas giigisida gatey haysa” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1"/>Yaatin Iyyobi haysada yaagidi zaaris;<verse eid="JOB 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2"/>Ane ta oda akeekidi si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">hessi hinte tana minthethida mela gido.<verse eid="JOB 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3"/>Taani issi toho odetana mela taw wode immite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">taani haasaya simmiko tana qelqisite.<verse eid="JOB 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4"/>Taani mootetey asara gidenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">Yaatin, danda7ay wuriko hessi malaalsiyee?<verse eid="JOB 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5"/>Ane tana xeellidi malaaletite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">hinte kushiya hinte doona bolla wothite.<verse eid="JOB 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6"/>Ta hessa qopiya wode tana daganthees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">ta asatethay kokorees.<verse eid="JOB 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7"/>Iita asati ayis paxa de7oona?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">Enta laythay ayis aduqii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">Enta wolqay ayis dari dari bidee?<verse eid="JOB 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8"/>Enta naytinne nayta nayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">diccishininne injen de7ishin enti ayis be7oona?<verse eid="JOB 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9"/>Enta soy hirgi bayna saro de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">Xoossaa xam7ay enta gakenna.<verse eid="JOB 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10"/>Enta miizati biraysi ekidi koxokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">yelishe awucayokona.<verse eid="JOB 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11"/>Banta nayta dorsaa wudeda kessoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">enta nayti duroosona.<verse eid="JOB 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12"/>Karaabo baqishe diithi diixishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">suusul7e punnishe ufaysan yexoosona.<verse eid="JOB 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13"/>Enti banta de7o laytha injen de7idi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">duufo sarora boosona.<verse eid="JOB 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14"/>Gidoshin, enti Xoossaako “Nuupe haaka!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">Nuuni ne ogiya eranaw koyoko” yaagosona.<verse eid="JOB 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15"/>“Nu iya goyinnanaw Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Nu iya woossidi ay go7etanee?” yaagosona.<verse eid="JOB 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16"/>Enti duretetha banta minotethan demmida goosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">shin taani enta qofaa ekike.<verse eid="JOB 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17"/>“Hanoshin, iita asaa xompey to7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Entana boshi gaki erii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Xoossay ba hanquwan enta seeri erii?<verse eid="JOB 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18"/>Carkoy enta kaleda efida wodey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">Gotey enta baanada denthida wodey de7ii?<verse eid="JOB 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19"/>Hinte, ‘Xoossi aawata bala gisho enta nayta seerees’ yaageeta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">Ane Xoossay nagaranchota enta huuphen seero;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">yaatiko enti banta naaquwa erana.<verse eid="JOB 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20"/>Nagaranchoti banta seera bantaw eko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaa hanqoy enta bolla wodho.<verse eid="JOB 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21"/>Asi hayqidaape guye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">ba naytabaa ay erii?<verse eid="JOB 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22"/>“Dhoqa bessan de7eyisata pirdiya Xoossaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">eratethi tamaarsanaw danda7iya asi de7ii?<verse eid="JOB 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23"/>Issi issi asi kumetha wolqaynne saroy de7ishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">inje duussu de7ishe hayqoosona.<verse eid="JOB 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24"/>Enta asatethay orde shin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">enta meqethaa kolizey shica de7ishin hayqoosona.<verse eid="JOB 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25"/>Shin harati lo77oba be7onna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">meton un7etidi kayotida mela hayqoosona.<verse eid="JOB 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26"/>Nam7ayka hayqidi biittan moogetosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">enti guxuntoosona.<verse eid="JOB 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27"/>“Hinte tana qohanaw qopidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">hinte wozanan qopida qofaa ta loythada erayis.<verse eid="JOB 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28"/>Hinte, ‘He gita uraa keethay awunee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">Iita oothiya uray de7iya soy awunee?’ yaageeta.<verse eid="JOB 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29"/>Oge asata oychibeeketii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">Enta markatethaa ammanibeketii?<verse eid="JOB 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30"/>Enti, ‘Iita asay dhayo gallas qohetokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">Xoossaa hanqoy qonciya gallas enti attana’ yaagosona.<verse eid="JOB 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31"/>Iita asi iya iitatethaa gisho kaccanay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">Iya oosuwa gisho iya seeranay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32"/>I hayqin, iya aha duufo efoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">iya duufoy bonchon naagetees.<verse eid="JOB 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33"/>Zangaara biittay iyaw injetees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">daro asay iya sinthan boosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">tayboy bayna asay iya kaalloosona.<verse eid="JOB 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34"/>Yaatin, hinte tana pathonna qaalan waati minthethanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">Hinte ta oyshaas zaariya zaaro ubbay wordo” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Elfaaza Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1"/>Hessafe guye, Temaana biittafe yida Elfaazi haysada yaagidi zaaris;<verse eid="JOB 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2"/>“Asi Xoosse go77anaw danda7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Hari attoshin cinca gidikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">bana go77anaape attishin, Xoosse go77enna.<verse eid="JOB 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3"/>Neeni xillo gidiko hessi Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaa ufaysiyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">Ne ogey borey baynaba gidiko hessan I ay wodhe demmii?<verse eid="JOB 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4"/>“I nena seereynne pirdey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">Neeni iyaw yayya gishoyee?<verse eid="JOB 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5"/>Ne iitatethay daro gidenneyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">Ne nagaraas zawi baawa gidennee?<verse eid="JOB 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6"/>Gaasoy bayna ne ishata waase xeegisadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">asaa ma7uwa qaara ekada enta kallo yeddadasa.<verse eid="JOB 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7"/>Saamotidaysata haathe ushshabaaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">koshatidaysata kathi muzabaaka.<verse eid="JOB 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8"/>Neeni wolqaama, durenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">bonchetida asi gidada de7ashe,<verse eid="JOB 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9"/>Am7eta mela kushe yeddadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">yi7otas wolqa dhaysadasa.<verse eid="JOB 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10"/>Ne yuushoy gitetiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">akeekona yashshi nena kokorsey hessasa.<verse eid="JOB 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11"/>Ne be7onna mela dhumiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">qassi kixa haathan ne muuketiday hessasa.<verse eid="JOB 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12"/>“Xoossay dhoqa saluwan uttidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">dhoqan de7iya xoolintota duge xeellees.<verse eid="JOB 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13"/>Shin neeni, ‘Xoossi ay erii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">Sakana dhumaa giddora kanthidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">pirdanaw danda7ii?<verse eid="JOB 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14"/>Salo gufantho bolla I simeretiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">I be7onna mela siketida shaaray iya goozees’ yaagasa.<verse eid="JOB 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15"/>Nagaranchoti hemetida beni ogiyara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">baanaw qofaa qachadii?<verse eid="JOB 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16"/>Entaw wodey gakonna de7ishin hayqidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">enta de7o baasoy di7on meecetidi dhayis.<verse eid="JOB 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17"/>Enti Xoossaako, ‘Nuupe haaka!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay nuus ay oothanaw danda7ii?’ yaagidosona.<verse eid="JOB 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18"/>Gidikoka, enta keetha lo77oban kunthiday Xoossaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">Hessa gisho, iita asaa qofaa ta ekike.<verse eid="JOB 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19"/>“Iita asati seeretiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">xilloti ufaytoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">suure asati haysada yaagidi, enta bolla qelqisoosona.<verse eid="JOB 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20"/>‘Nu morketi dhayidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">enta duretethay tamas attis’ yaagosona.<verse eid="JOB 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21"/>“Iyyoba, ha77ika Xoossara giiga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">iyara saro de7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">yaatiko neeni anjetana.<verse eid="JOB 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22"/>Iya timirtiya si7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">iya qaala ne wozanan wotha.<verse eid="JOB 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23"/>Neeni Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaako simmiko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">new sa7i simmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">iita ooso ubbaa ne soope digga;<verse eid="JOB 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24"/>Ne worqaa sa7an hola;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">ne Ofira worqaa shaafan yegga.<verse eid="JOB 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25"/>Yaatiko Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">new worqanne dooretida bira gidana.<verse eid="JOB 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26"/>He wode ne Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossan ufaytana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">yeellatonna Xoossako pude xeellana.<verse eid="JOB 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27"/>Neeni iya woossana, I nena si7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">ne qangetha iyaw gathana.<verse eid="JOB 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28"/>Ne qopidabay poletana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">ne hemetiya ogey poo7o gidana.<verse eid="JOB 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29"/>Xoossay otoreyisata kawushshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">shin ashketa ashshees.<verse eid="JOB 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30"/>Ne kushey geeshshi gidiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">bala asay ne gaason maarota ekananne attana” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1"/>Iyyobi haysada yaagidi zaaris;<verse eid="JOB 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2"/>Hachika ta cametada zuuzumayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">ta ooley mino gidikoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">iya kushey ta bolla deexeysa aggibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3"/>Iya demmana bessaa ta erida gidarkina;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">I de7iya bessaa ta gakarkina!<verse eid="JOB 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4"/>Taani ta metuwa iya sinthan wothanashin!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">Ta doona mooton kunthanashin!<verse eid="JOB 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5"/>I taw zaaranay aybeko eranashin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">I ay giyako be7anashin!<verse eid="JOB 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6"/>I ba gita wolqan taara eqetanesha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">Akay, I tana si7ana.<verse eid="JOB 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7"/>Yan suure asi iyara mootetanaw danda7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">ta daynnay tana merinaw shatinthana.<verse eid="JOB 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8"/>Shin taani doloha biiko I yan deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">taani wuloha biiko iya yan demmike.<verse eid="JOB 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9"/>I pudehan oothiya wode taani iya be7ike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">dugeha bagga simmiya wode taani iya demmike.<verse eid="JOB 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10"/>Shin I ta tanguwa ubbaa erees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">I tana paaciya wode taani worqada geeyada keyana.<verse eid="JOB 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11"/>Ta tohoy iya tanguwa kaallidi bees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">iya ogiyape haddirsi ushachi simmabike.<verse eid="JOB 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12"/>Iya doonape keyiya kiitaape taani shaaketabike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">iya qaala ta wozanan wothas.<verse eid="JOB 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13"/>Xoossay laametenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">Iyara eqetanay baawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">I koydaba oothees.<verse eid="JOB 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14"/>I ta bolla qopidaysa polis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">hessa mela hara daro halchoti iyaw de7oosona.<verse eid="JOB 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15"/>Hessa gisho, iya sinthan eqanaw daro yashshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">hessa ubbaa qopiya wode kokorayis.<verse eid="JOB 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16"/>Xoossay ta wozanay doccana mela oothis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">Ubbaa danda7iya Xoossay tana daganthis.<verse eid="JOB 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17"/>Sakana dhumay ta som7uwa goozikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">tana he dhumay haasaya diggibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 23:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1"/>Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay pirda wode ayis qanxennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">Iya ereysati he wodiya ayis coo naagonna?<verse eid="JOB 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2"/>Iita asati zawan de7iya shuchaa denthoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">kaysi ehida dorsata yan heemmoosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3"/>Yi7o nayta hareta bonqoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">am7e booraa acos oykidi ekoosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4"/>Manqota shaatetidi ogepe gooddosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">banta sinthafe qosetana mela oothosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5"/>Bazzon de7iya wora hare mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">manqoti banta naytas miyaba koyishe daaburoosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6"/>Enti hara asa gaden kathi cakoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">iita asaa woyne gaden budhe maxoosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7"/>Enti qamma kallo aqoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">meegos bolla yeggiyabay entaw baawa.<verse eid="JOB 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8"/>Zuma bolla bukiya iran enti suuruxoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">geliya bessi dhayidi shucha hom7on aqoosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9"/>Aawi bayna na7a aaye ki7ope dafi ekoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">manquwa na7a acos oykoosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10"/>Manqoti ma7o dhayidi kallo hemetoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">enti bantaw koshatishe hara asa mirqe tookosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11"/>Enti bantaw saamotishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">zayte kessanaw hara asa gaden shamaho ayfe maxoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">woyne ushsha gum7anaw woyne ayfe qoroosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12"/>Kataman kataman hayqana haniya asay oolosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">deshetidi madunxida asay maado koyidi waassoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">shin Xoossay enta metuwa xeellenna.<verse eid="JOB 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13"/>Poo7o ixiya asati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">iya ogiya eronna asatinne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">iyan eqona asati de7oosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14"/>Sa7i qammiya wode shempo wodheysi dendidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">manqotanne metootanchota wodhees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">qammi qassi kaysos boosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15"/>Laymatiya asi sa7i lem7anaysa naagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">oonika be7onna mela ba som7uwa kammees.<verse eid="JOB 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16"/>Kaysoti qamma keethe bookidi kaysotanaw geloosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">shin gallas qosetidi pee7osona.<verse eid="JOB 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17"/>Daganthiya dhumara enti dabbotiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">sakana dhumay entaw seeta gallasa mela.<verse eid="JOB 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18"/>“Shin iita asati haatha goponto mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">enta laata biittay baadetidaysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">oonika enta woyne gade beenna.<verse eid="JOB 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19"/>Shachi maayin, haathi melidi dhayeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">nagaranchoti hayqidi biittafe dhayoosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20"/>Yelida aayeti enta dogana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">Guxuney enta ashuwa maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">iita asay hassayetokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">mithada meqana.<verse eid="JOB 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21"/>Enti na7i bayna mayntha maccasa naaqidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">am7eta qadhetonna ixidosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22"/>Xoossay ba wolqan minota dhaysis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">entaw sa7i injetida daanikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">kundonna attokona.<verse eid="JOB 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23"/>Xoossay enti saro daanada oothikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">enta ogiya wochees.<verse eid="JOB 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24"/>Iita asati guutha wodes dhoqu dhoqu goosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">shin ellesidi sharaafada shullidi dhayoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">kathada caketoosona.<verse eid="JOB 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25"/>Hessi hanenna gidi kaddiya asi de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">taani odida qaala wordo gaana asi de7ii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Baldadoosa Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1"/>Hessafe guye, Shuuha biittafe yida Beldadoosi haysada yaagidi zaaris;<verse eid="JOB 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2"/>“Xoossay haareysanne yashsheysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">I dhoqa saluwa sarotethan haarees.<verse eid="JOB 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3"/>Iya olanchota taybanaw danda7iya asi de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">Xoossa poo7oy gakonna bessi de7ii?<verse eid="JOB 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4"/>Yaatin, asi Xoossaa sinthan xillo gidanaw danda7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">Maccasape yeletida asi geeshshi gidanaw danda7ii?<verse eid="JOB 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5"/>Xoossaa sinthan ageenika kumetha poo7o gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">iya sinthan xoolintotika geeshshi gidokona.<verse eid="JOB 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6"/>Yaatin, Xoossaa sinthan wooqanne guxune gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">asi ay mela laafee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 25:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1"/>Iyyobi haysada yaagidi zaaris;<verse eid="JOB 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2"/>“Neeni wolqi baynaysa ayba maaddadii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">Daaburanchuwa waata ashshadii?<verse eid="JOB 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3"/>Cincatethi pacidaysas ay zore immadii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">Ay mela eratethi qoncisadii?<verse eid="JOB 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4"/>Neeni ha qaala odetana mela nena maaddiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">Ne odan mela nena denthethiday oodde ayyaanee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baldadoosa Haasaya</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5"/>Beldadoosi zaaridi, “Hayqida asaa ayyaanati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">garsan haatha giddon de7eysati kokoroosona.<verse eid="JOB 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6"/>Xoossa sinthan Si7ooley qonce;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">aybika iya genthanaw danda7enna.<verse eid="JOB 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7"/>Xoossay pudeha salota coo miccis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">sa7aa kaqoy bayna bessan kaqis.<verse eid="JOB 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8"/>I shaaratan haathe kunthees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">haatha deexuwan shaarati daaketokona.<verse eid="JOB 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9"/>I ba shaara miccidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">kumtha ageena kammees.<verse eid="JOB 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10"/>Poo7o dhumape shaakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">abba gaxan Xoossay zawa wothis.<verse eid="JOB 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11"/>I hanqetiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">salo tuuqeti dagaman kokoroosona.<verse eid="JOB 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12"/>Ba wolqan abba si77i oothees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">ba cincatethan Ra7aaba geetetiya do7aa dhaysees.<verse eid="JOB 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13"/>I ba shempuwan salota geeshshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">iya kushey xongetiya shooshaa caddees.<verse eid="JOB 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14"/>Haysati Xoossay oothiya oosotape guuthata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">nu iya kalkashaa xalaala si7oos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">iya wolqaa deshuwa akeekanaw danda7ey oonee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 26:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1"/>Iyyobi kaallidi haysada yaagis;<verse eid="JOB 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2"/>“Suure pirdaa tana diggidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">ta de7uwa camo oothida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossan taani caaqayis.<verse eid="JOB 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3"/>Ta shempoy de7ishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">ta siidhey shempishin<verse eid="JOB 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4"/>ta doonay wordo odetenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">ta inxarsay cimo odetenna.<verse eid="JOB 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5"/>Hinte oday like gada ta ekike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">hayqana gakanaw ta tana suure geysa aggike.<verse eid="JOB 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6"/>Ta xillotethaa mintha oykanaape attishin, aggike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">ta de7ida laytha ubban ta kahay tana mootenna.<verse eid="JOB 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7"/>“Ta morketi nagaranchoda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">taara eqeteysati bala gido.<verse eid="JOB 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8"/>Xoossay enta shempuwa entafe ekiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">enta laytha qaamisiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">iitatas de7iya ufaysay aybee?<verse eid="JOB 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9"/>Enta bolla metoy gakiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:9">Xoossay enta waasuwa si7ii?<verse eid="JOB 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10"/>Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossan enti ufaytanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Enti ubba wode Xoossaa xeeganee?<verse eid="JOB 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11"/>“Taani hintena Xoossaa wolqaaba tamaarsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaa qofaa ta hintefe qottike.<verse eid="JOB 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12"/>Hinte ubbay hessa be7ideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">yaatin, haysa mela coo haasaya ayis odeteetii?<verse eid="JOB 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13"/>Xoossay iita asatas giigisida qaaday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaafe ekiya woytoy haysa.<verse eid="JOB 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14"/>Enta nayti ay darikoka olan wurana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">enta kochay miyaba dhayidi koshatana.<verse eid="JOB 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15"/>Hessafe attidaysati gadon wurana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">enta am7eti entaw yeekokona.<verse eid="JOB 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16"/>Iita asati bira biittada shiishikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">ma7o urqada shiishidi doorikoka,<verse eid="JOB 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17"/>enta bira xillo asati shaaki ekana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">enta ma7uwa geeshshati ma7ana.<verse eid="JOB 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18"/>Enti keexiya keethati shango haada melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">gaabba mela laaletana.<verse eid="JOB 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19"/>Iita asati dure gididi hiixan zin7oosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">shin enti dhiskofe barkiya wode aykoyka baawa.<verse eid="JOB 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20"/>Dagami di7o haathada qoponna enta bolla yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">qamma gotey enta denthidi efana.<verse eid="JOB 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21"/>Doloha carkoy enti de7iyasuwape pitidi efana.<verse eid="JOB 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22"/>Enti kessi ekanaw baqatishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">qadhey bayna enta bolla wodhana.<verse eid="JOB 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23"/>Ba kushiya baqidi enta bolla qelqisana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">ba suyqethan enta sugi yeddana.<verse eid="JOB 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1"/>“Bira bookidi kessiya bessinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">worqaa seerisiya bessi de7ees.<verse eid="JOB 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2"/>Birati biittafe keyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">naase birati shuchu seerisin keyees.<verse eid="JOB 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3"/>Asay xompe ekidi dhumaa poo7isees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">biitta gaathi gakanaw gelees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">sakana dhuman he shuchaa koyees.<verse eid="JOB 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4"/>Asay de7iya bessaafe haakidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">asa tohoy yedhi eronna soo gakidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">yan gita olla bookees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:4">Wodoron yaanne haanne kuullotishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">asaape koxetidi de7ees.<verse eid="JOB 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5"/>Kathi biittafe mokees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">shin iya giddoy taman seeridi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">shireti shireti wodhees.<verse eid="JOB 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6"/>He zaallafe sanpare geetetiya al7o shuchay keyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">iya biittafe worqay bentees.<verse eid="JOB 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7"/>He shuchaa bookiya bessa xiloy erenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">phircoyka be7ibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8"/>Iita do7ati he bessaa yedhi erokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">gaammoy yaara aadhibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9"/>Asi mino zaalla mentherethees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">deriya bookidi xaphuwape aathidi yeggees.<verse eid="JOB 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10"/>Zaalla lukidi kanthiya oge kessees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">he al7o shuchaa demmees.<verse eid="JOB 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11"/>Haathi he bessaara goggonna mela zeeres;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">geemmidabata poo7o kessees.<verse eid="JOB 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12"/>“Shin cincatethi awupe bentanaw danda7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">Akeeki de7iya awee?<verse eid="JOB 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13"/>Asi iya gatiya erenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">I de7on de7iya medhetethati de7iya biittan bentenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14"/>Abbaa ciimmoy, ‘Cincatethi ta giddon baawa’ yaagees.<verse eid="JOB 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15"/>Cincatethi worqan shametenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">woyko biran bentenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16"/>Cincatethi Ofira worqan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">margidenne sanpare geetetiya al7o shuchan shametenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17"/>Worqinne mastootey iyara liketenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">worqafe oosetida al7o miishen laametenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18"/>Cincatetha gatey zaagolepe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">almaazepenne al7o shucha ubbaafe aadhees.<verse eid="JOB 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19"/>Toophaze geetetiya Tophe inqoy iyara liketenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">walahi bayna worqan I shametenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20"/>“Yaatin, cincatethi awupe yii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:20">Akeeki awupe bentii?<verse eid="JOB 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21"/>De7on de7iya medhetetha ubbaafe geemmidi de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">salo kafoti iya demmokona.<verse eid="JOB 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22"/>Gadoynne hayqoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">‘Nuuni cincatethaba haythan si7ida’ yaagosona.<verse eid="JOB 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23"/>“Cincatethako efiya ogiyanne I de7iya bessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">erey Xoossaa xalaala.<verse eid="JOB 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24"/>Xoossay sa7aa gaxa ubbaa xeellees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">salope garsan de7iyaba ubbaa be7ees.<verse eid="JOB 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25"/>Xoossay carkos wolqaa immida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">haatha makida wode,<verse eid="JOB 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26"/>iri bukana woga immida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">dadas oge wothida wode,<verse eid="JOB 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27"/>Xoossay cincatetha be7is;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">be7idi bonchis; paacidi essis.<verse eid="JOB 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28"/>He wode Xoossay asako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">‘Cincatethi Xoossas yayyeysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">akeeki iitaape haakeysa’ yaagees” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1"/>Iyyobi kaallidi haysada yaagis;<verse eid="JOB 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2"/>Ha77i ta de7iya duussay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">Xoossay beni tana naagida wodiyatho gideerenne!<verse eid="JOB 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3"/>He wode iya xompey ta bolla poo7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">iya poo7uwan dhumaa kanthada bayis.<verse eid="JOB 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4"/>He wodey Xoossay ta keethaa anjin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">taani ta na7atetha wolqara de7ida wode.<verse eid="JOB 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5"/>He wode Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay taape shaaketibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">ta nayti ta yuushon de7oosona.<verse eid="JOB 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6"/>He wode taani ta kushiya maathan meeccayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">shucha biittan toketida shamahoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">shaafa haathada goggiya zayte immees.<verse eid="JOB 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7"/>Taani katamaa pirda keethaa bida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">shangotara issife uttayis.<verse eid="JOB 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8"/>He wode na7atethati tana be7idi oge yeddoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">cimati tana bonchanaw dendi eqidosona.<verse eid="JOB 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9"/>Halaqati oda aggaagidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">banta kushiya banta doona bolla wothidosona.<verse eid="JOB 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10"/>He kataman de7iya gita asati si77i gidoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">enta inxarsay enta kottonuwa baqidi oykis.<verse eid="JOB 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11"/>Tabaa si7ida ubbay nashshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">tana be7ida ubbay bonchees.<verse eid="JOB 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12"/>Hessi haniday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">taani manqota waasuwa si7ada ashshida gishonne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">yi7o nayta maaddida gishosa.<verse eid="JOB 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13"/>Hayqana haniya asati tana anjidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">am7eti ta maaduwan ufaytidosona.<verse eid="JOB 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14"/>Xillotethaa ma7oda ma7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">suure pirdaa afilada ma7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">barneexada wothas.<verse eid="JOB 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15"/>Taani qooqetas ayfe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">wobbetas toho gidas.<verse eid="JOB 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16"/>Manqotas aawa gidas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">oge asas xabaqa gidas.<verse eid="JOB 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17"/>Taani iitata gacuwa menthas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">enti bonqidaysa enta doonape yegisas.<verse eid="JOB 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18"/>Taani ta wozanan, “Ta laythay shafeda darin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">ta son bonchon hayqana” gada qopas.<verse eid="JOB 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19"/>Taani xaphuwa haathan yeddida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">tashiya bolla aki kumida mitha melashin!<verse eid="JOB 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20"/>Ta bonchetida mela de7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">ta wolqay ubba wode oorathishin!<verse eid="JOB 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21"/>Ta haasaya wode si77i gidi si7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">ta zoriya ufaysan ekoosona.<verse eid="JOB 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22"/>Ta entana alliya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">ta oda simmin taape guyera odiya asi baawa.<verse eid="JOB 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23"/>Goshshanchoy ira naageysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">enti ta haasaya si7anaw hakankidi naagoosona.<verse eid="JOB 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24"/>Enti hirgan de7ishin ta som7uwa pashkisayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">ta miichay enta minthethees.<verse eid="JOB 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25"/>Taani enti daana ogiya doorada entaw halaqa gidas.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">Ba olanchota giddon de7iya kawoda ta enta giddon de7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">enti azzaniya wode minthethas.<verse eid="JOB 29:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1"/>Shin ha77i taape na7attiya asati tana qelqisoosona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">Enti ta dorsa wudiya heemmiya kanatara pee7onna mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">taani diggida aawata nayta.<verse eid="JOB 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2"/>Enta aawati wolqi ixidaysatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">gilqata gidiya gisho tana aykoka maaddibokona.<verse eid="JOB 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3"/>Metoynne koshi un7ethin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">biitta bazzo bidi xapho coommosona.<verse eid="JOB 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4"/>Cumadhenne bonco maxidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">mal7onna sankara xapho midosona.<verse eid="JOB 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5"/>Asi waassishe kayso gooddeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">entana asaa giddofe gooddidosona.<verse eid="JOB 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6"/>Enti zangaaran, gongoloninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">zaalla qophon de7idosona.<verse eid="JOB 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7"/>Enti woran do7ada waassishe yuuyidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">aguntha giddon shiiqidi issife de7idosona.<verse eid="JOB 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8"/>Enti biittafe goodetidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">sunthi bayna eeyata gididi de7idosona.<verse eid="JOB 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9"/>Ha77i enta nayti tana yethan caddoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">taani enta giddon hayses attas.<verse eid="JOB 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10"/>Enti tana shaatetidi taape haakoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">yeellatonna ta som7on cuttoosona.<verse eid="JOB 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11"/>Xoossay ta wolqaa laafethidi tana kawushida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">enti tana qohanaw yeda para gididosona.<verse eid="JOB 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12"/>Seeri bayna diccida nayti ta bolla dendidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">ta tohuwas xihe wothidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">enti tana dhaysanaw teqidosona.<verse eid="JOB 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13"/>Enti ta ogiya gordidi tana dhaysanaw koyoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">enti hessa oothonna mela teqiya oonika baawa.<verse eid="JOB 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14"/>Olanchoti katama dirsaa menthidi geleysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">enti ta bolla yidosona.<verse eid="JOB 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15"/>Taani gita dagama dagammas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">ta bonchoy carkoy efiyada bis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">ta saro duussay shaarada dhayis.<verse eid="JOB 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16"/>Ta shempiya daro un7etasu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:16">metoy tana cuucummidi oykis.<verse eid="JOB 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17"/>Qamma qamma sahoy ta meqetha coommees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">seelay taw shempo immenna.<verse eid="JOB 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18"/>Xoossay ba gita wolqan ta ma7uwa shiishidi oykis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">qoodhe oykiya ma7oda tana cuullis.<verse eid="JOB 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19"/>Xoossay tana urqan holis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">taani baananne bidinthe gidas.<verse eid="JOB 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20"/>Abeeti Xoossaw, taani neeko waassayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">shin neeni tana allabaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:20">Eqada nena woossas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">shin neeni ta woosa si7abaka.<verse eid="JOB 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21"/>Neeni taw wozana mino gidadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">ne gita wolqan tana yedethaasa.<verse eid="JOB 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22"/>Neeni tana carkora denthada gooddadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">goten tana harqadasa.<verse eid="JOB 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23"/>Asa ubbaas wursethi gidida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">hayqos ne tana aatha immanaysa erayis.<verse eid="JOB 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24"/>Meqida asi, “Tana maaddarki” gidi waassin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">iyaw qadhetonna asi de7ii?<verse eid="JOB 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25"/>waayen de7eysatas ta yeekabikina?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">manqotas ta qadhetabikina?<verse eid="JOB 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26"/>Lo77oba demmana gada amotas shin iitabay gakis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">Taw sa7i keehana gada naagas shin gallasi taw dhumis.<verse eid="JOB 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27"/>Ta wozanay hirga aggibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">taani wopa demmabike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">un7a qammi ta bolla gakis.<verse eid="JOB 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28"/>Ta asatethay awa suulon gidonashin azzanon kareexis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">taani deriya shiiquwan eqada maade koyayis.<verse eid="JOB 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29"/>Taani worakanatas isha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">diidinthas lagge gidas.<verse eid="JOB 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30"/>Ta gogay kareexidi poqeti poqeti wodhees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">ta asatethay mishan xuugetees.<verse eid="JOB 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31"/>Ta ufaysi qoncisiya diithinne suusul7ey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">ha77i ta zelelsas gidis.<verse eid="JOB 30:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1"/>“Geela7o xeellada amottonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">taani ta ayfiyara caaqetas.<verse eid="JOB 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2"/>Bollan de7iya Xoossaa matape asas imetida qaaday aybee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">Salon de7iya Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay asas immiya gishoy aybee?<verse eid="JOB 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3"/>Iitata bolla boshi, bala ootheyisata bolla gadoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">gakanaysi eretidaba gidenneyee?<verse eid="JOB 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4"/>Xoossay ta ogiya ubbaa be7eneyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">ta tanguwa ubbaa taybeneyee?<verse eid="JOB 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5"/>“Taani wordon de7idaba gidiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">ase cimmidaba gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6"/>Xoossay tana like mizaanen mazzano;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">yaatidi ta xillo gideysa be7o.<verse eid="JOB 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7"/>Ta hemethay ogepe keydaba gidiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">ta wozanay ta ayfey xeellidaba amotidaba gidiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">ta kushey nagaran tunidaba gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8"/>ta dolay shodetidi dhayo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">ta zeridaysa hari mo.<verse eid="JOB 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9"/>“Ta wozanay hara maccas amotidaba gidiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">woyko taani ta shooruwa machiw geeddidaba gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10"/>ta machiya hara asas gaacco;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">iira hara addey aqo.<verse eid="JOB 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11"/>Hessi yeellayiya nagaras koshshiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">gita pirda.<verse eid="JOB 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12"/>Ha nagaray tamada xuuggiyaba gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">ta aquwa ubbaa dhaysanashin.<verse eid="JOB 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13"/>“Ta adde woyko ta macca aylleti abeeti gin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">entaw pirdonna ixidaba gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14"/>Xoossa sinthan ta pirdas shiiqiya wode waananee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">I tana oychiya wode taani woyga zaaranee?<verse eid="JOB 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15"/>Tana medhida Xoossay enta I medhibeneyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">Nuna ubbaa nu aaye ulon medhiday issi iya gidenneyee?<verse eid="JOB 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16"/>“Taani manqoti woossidaba diggidaba gidiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">woyko am7eta minthethonna aggidaba gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17"/>yi7o nayti mela aqiya wode be7ashe, taani tarka midaba gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18"/>Taani enta ta na7atethafe doomada enta aawada dichas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">ta yeletoosope doomada am7eta maaddas.<verse eid="JOB 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19"/>Ma7oy dhayin meegoy wodhiya uraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">woyko kallo de7iya metootanchuwa be7ada,<verse eid="JOB 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20"/>ta dorsata ikisepe oosetida ma7o mayzin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">tana anjona biday de7iko,<verse eid="JOB 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21"/>Taani mooton enta shatimmanaysa erada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">yi7o nayta naaqidaba gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22"/>ta qesey kuriyape me77o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:22">ta kushey hashiyape kareti wodho.<verse eid="JOB 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23"/>Xoossaa hanquwa yayyida gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">hessa oothanaw danda7ike.<verse eid="JOB 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24"/>“Taani worqan ammanetidaba gidiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">woyko walahi bayna worqaa ‘Ta ceeqoy nena’ gidaba gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25"/>Ta duretetha darotethan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">ta kushey demmida wodhen ufaytidaba gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26"/>Awa phoolethi be7ada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">woyko ageena lo77otethi xeellada,<verse eid="JOB 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27"/>ta wozanay geeman enta nashshibeenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">woyko ta enta yeerada goyinnabike.<verse eid="JOB 31:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28"/>Hessi pirda ehiya nagara gidiya gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">Xoossaa kaddas guussu.<verse eid="JOB 31:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29"/>“Ta morketa kundethan ufaytabike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">enta gakida metuwan hashshu gabike.<verse eid="JOB 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30"/>‘Ta morkey dhayo’ yaaga baaddada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">nagara oothabike.<verse eid="JOB 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31"/>Ta soo asay, ‘Iya son</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">kathi midi kallonnay oonee?’ yaagidi markatoosona.<verse eid="JOB 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32"/>Ta soy ubba wode dooya gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">oge asi karen aqi erenna.<verse eid="JOB 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33"/>Harati ootheysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">ta nagaraa ta wozanan genthabike.<verse eid="JOB 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34"/>Asa pokos yayyada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">enta boriyas dagammada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">soo gelada qosetida wodey deenna.<verse eid="JOB 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35"/>“Tana si7iya asi de7eerenneshin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Ta oday tuma gideysa paramayis;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:35">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay taw zaaro immo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Ta morkey ba mootuwa xaafidi shiishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">ta be7arkinashin.<verse eid="JOB 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36"/>Be7iyako woytoda qoodhen aathada ma7anashin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">Kallachada ta huuphen wothanashin!<verse eid="JOB 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37"/>Taani maati de7iya asada xoossaako shiiqada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">ta oothidaba ubbaa iyaw qoncisanashin!<verse eid="JOB 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38"/>“Ta goshsha biittay ta bolla waassidaba gidiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">daasatika afuthan laakidaba gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 31:38"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39"/>he biittan kaxidaba miishe qanxonna ekidaba gidiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">woyko he biitta ootheyisata koshan wodhidaba gidiko,<verse eid="JOB 31:39"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40"/>taw he biittan giste gisho agunthi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">banga gisho sharaafi dolo” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Iyyoba oday hessan poletis.<verse eid="JOB 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Elihu Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1"/>Iyyobi, “Taani xillo asi” gida gisho, ha heedzu asati iyaw zaaro imo aggaagidosona. <verse eid="JOB 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2"/>Iyyobi Xoossaafe aathidi bana xillo oothida gisho, Rama yarape gidida Buza biittafe yida Barkela na7ay Elihuy Iyyoba bolla hanqetis. <verse eid="JOB 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3"/>Enti iya coo bala gidi pirdidi, iyaw bessiya zaaro immanaw danda7iboona gisho Elihuy ha heedzu laggeta bollaka hanqetis. <verse eid="JOB 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4"/>Elihuy entafe kaalotiya gisho enti ubbay haasaya wursana gakanaw naagis. <verse eid="JOB 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5"/>Ha heedzu asati Iyyobas bessiya zaaro immanaw danda7iboonaysa be7idi I daro yilotis.<verse eid="JOB 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6"/>Buza biittafe yida Barkela na7ay Elihuy haysada yaagidi haasaya doomis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">“Taani hintefe na7atayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">hinte taape bayrateta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">Hessa gisho, taani ta qofaa hintew odanaw yayyas.<verse eid="JOB 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7"/>Taani, ‘Cimati odeto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">banta daro laythan demmida cincatethaa tamaarsonna’ ” gada qopas.<verse eid="JOB 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8"/>Shin asa giddon aqidi cincatethi immey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaa Ayyaana.<verse eid="JOB 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9"/>Ase cinca oothey cimatethi gidenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">woyko asas akeeka immey laytha darotethi gidenna.<verse eid="JOB 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10"/>Hessa gisho, si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">taka ta qofaa hintew odana.<verse eid="JOB 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11"/>Hinte haasaya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">taani si77i gada hayzas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">hinte odana qaala koyishin naagas.<verse eid="JOB 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12"/>Hinte geysa ubbaa wursada si7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">shin hintefe oonika Iyyoba bala gidi ammanthibena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">hintefe oonika iya palamas bessiya zaaro immibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13"/>Iyyoba odaas kalsiya zaaro immanaw danda7ey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">Xoossefe attishin, ase gidonna gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">hinte, “Nuus cincatethi de7ees” goopite.<verse eid="JOB 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14"/>Iyyobi palamiday taara gidonashin hintera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">taani hinte odada iyaw zaaro immike.<verse eid="JOB 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15"/>Enti dagammidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">gaanaba dhayida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">zaaro immanaw danda7ibookona.<verse eid="JOB 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16"/>Yaatin enti odetiyaba dhayidi si77i gidi eqiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">taani naaganaw koshshii?<verse eid="JOB 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17"/>Gidenna, taani odiyabay de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">taka ta qofaa qoncisana.<verse eid="JOB 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18"/>Ta odanabay daroy de7iya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">ta giddon de7iya ayyaanay tana oda gidi sugees.<verse eid="JOB 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19"/>Ta gaathay goozetida manaaceda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">woyko mal7anto woyne ushshi kumida ogoroda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">dhuuqana hanees.<verse eid="JOB 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20"/>Ta odada kessanaw bessees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">ta doona dooyada zaaro immanaw koshshees.<verse eid="JOB 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21"/>Ha odan taani oonaka maaddike,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">woyko oonaka coo sabbike.<verse eid="JOB 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22"/>Ase coo sabbiyabay taw eretenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">ta hessa oothiyako tana medhidaysi pirdanashin.<verse eid="JOB 32:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1"/>Iyyoba, ha77i ta odaa si7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">ta giyaba ubbaa hayza.<verse eid="JOB 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2"/>Taani ta doona dooyas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">ta qaalati ta inxarsaa xeeran de7oosona.<verse eid="JOB 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3"/>Ta qaalati ta wozana suuretetha qoncisosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">ta ereysa ta inxarsay tumatethan odees.<verse eid="JOB 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4"/>Tana medhiday Xoossaa Ayyaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaa shempoy taw de7o immis.<verse eid="JOB 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5"/>Ne danda7iko taw zaaro imma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">nena giigisada taara palama.<verse eid="JOB 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6"/>Taani Xoossaa sinthan ne mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">taanika urqafe medhetas.<verse eid="JOB 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7"/>Neeni taw yayiya gaasoy baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">taani nena naaqike.<verse eid="JOB 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8"/>“Ne haasaya ubbaa taani si7ashe gam7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">ne doonape keyida qaalata hayzas.<verse eid="JOB 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9"/>Taani geeshshinne borey bayna asi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">taani xillonne nagara oothaboonna asi.<verse eid="JOB 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10"/>Shin Xoossay tana seeranaw gaaso koyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">I tana ba morkeda taybees.<verse eid="JOB 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11"/>Ta tohuwa duxis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">ta tango ubbaa I wochees” yaagadasa.<verse eid="JOB 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12"/>“Iyyoba, ne oday like gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">ta new odayis, Xoossay asape aadhees.<verse eid="JOB 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13"/>‘Xoossay asa odaas zaaro immenna’ gada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">ayis iyara palamay?<verse eid="JOB 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14"/>Asi akeekennafe attishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">Xoossay dumma dumma ogera odees.<verse eid="JOB 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15"/>Asi qamma hiixan zin7idi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">dhisko eeyidi de7iya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">Xoossi amuhoninne qoncethan odees.<verse eid="JOB 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16"/>He wode asay si7anaada haythe dooyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">ba seeran enta daganthees.<verse eid="JOB 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17"/>Yaatidi asi nagara oothonna mela teqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">otoro asape diggees.<verse eid="JOB 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18"/>Xoossi ase dhayope ashshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">hayqopeka naagees.<verse eid="JOB 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19"/>Asi hargetidi hiixan de7ishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">iya meqethaa garsan qanxonna saho yeddidi seerees.<verse eid="JOB 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20"/>Hessada hanidi hargida uray kathi ixees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">daro mal7o kathi iya shaatees.<verse eid="JOB 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21"/>Iya ashoy gilqidi wurees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">iya asatethay melin meqethi taybetees.<verse eid="JOB 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22"/>Iya shempoy duufoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">iya de7oy hayqo kiitanchotako matees.<verse eid="JOB 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23"/>“Asas suure ogiya bessiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">mukulun taybetiya kiitanchotape</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">issoy iya maaddanaw danda7ees.<verse eid="JOB 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24"/>Iyaw qadhetidi, ‘I duufo gelonna mela iya ashsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">taani iya woziyaba demmas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">iya aggaaga’ yaagidi hayqos odees.<verse eid="JOB 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25"/>Hessa gisho, iya asatethay na7a asatethi gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">iya yalagatetha wolqay iyaw simmana.<verse eid="JOB 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26"/>He wode I Xoossaa woossana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">Xoossay iya woosa si7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">Xoossay iyaw iya xillotethaa zaariya gisho, I ufaysan Xoossaa goyinnana.<verse eid="JOB 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27"/>He wode asa sinthan I haysada yaagidi yexana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">‘Taani nagaraa oothas; suureba geellayas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">shin Xoossay ta hanuwa taw qanxibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28"/>Ta duufon gelonna mela tana ashshis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">ha77i paxa de7ada poo77o be7ayis’ yaagana.<verse eid="JOB 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29"/>“Heko, Xoossi asas hessa ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">zaari zaari oothees.<verse eid="JOB 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30"/>I de7o poo7o be7ana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:30">iya shempuwa duufope ashshees.<verse eid="JOB 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31"/>“Iyyoba, taani odeysa hayzada si7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">ane ne si77i ga; taani odetana.<verse eid="JOB 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32"/>Ne odanaw koyaabay de7iko oda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">taani ne xillo gideysa be7anaw koyayis.<verse eid="JOB 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33"/>Atto giiko si77i gada, ta haasaya si7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">ta nena cincatethi tamaarsana” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1"/>Qassika Elihuy haysada yaagis;<verse eid="JOB 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2"/>“Hinteno, cincato ta haasaya si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">hinteno, eranchoto tana hayzite.<verse eid="JOB 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3"/>Inxarsi mal7o kathi shaaki ereysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">haythi oda shaakidi erees.<verse eid="JOB 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4"/>Ane nuuni suureba shaakidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">lo77oba tamaaridi eroos.<verse eid="JOB 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5"/>“Iyyobi, ‘Taani xillo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:5">shin Xoossi tana suure pirdaa diggis.<verse eid="JOB 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6"/>Taani tuma shin wordancho gidas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">tanan bali baawa shin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">paxonna madunthi madunxisis’ yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7"/>Iyyobada Xoossa bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:7">qelqisiya asi de7ii?<verse eid="JOB 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8"/>I iita ootheysatara laggetees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">nagaranchotara hemetees.<verse eid="JOB 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9"/>I, ‘Asi Xoosse ufaysana gidi oothiyabay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">aykoka maaddenna’ yaagees.<verse eid="JOB 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10"/>“Hessa gisho, hinteno, akeekancho asato si7ite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">iita oosoy Xoossaafe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaafe bala oosoy haako.<verse eid="JOB 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11"/>Xoossay asas iya oosuwada immees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">iya ogiyada iyaw qanxees.<verse eid="JOB 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12"/>Xoossay tuma iita oothenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay suure pirdaa geellayenna.<verse eid="JOB 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13"/>Sa7a bolla iyaw maata immiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">biitta ubbaa bolla iya shuumiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14"/>Xoossay ba Ayyaananne ba de7o shempuwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">zaaridi baako ekiyako,<verse eid="JOB 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15"/>asho ma7ida ubbay issife dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">asi biitta simmanashin.<verse eid="JOB 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16"/>“New akeeki de7iko haysa si7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">ta haasaya hayza.<verse eid="JOB 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17"/>Suure pirdaa ixey haaranaw danda7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">Neeni xillonne wolqaama Xoossaa pirday?<verse eid="JOB 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18"/>Xoossay kawotako, ‘Hinte pathonayisata’;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">qassi biitta haareysatako, ‘Hinte iita’ yaagees.<verse eid="JOB 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19"/>Enti ubbay iya kushe oosota gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">Halaqata som7o xeellidi maaddenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">dureta manqotape aathidi xeellenna.<verse eid="JOB 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20"/>Enti gidi bilahe akeekona hayqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">ubbay kokorishe dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">wolqaamati asa kushey bochonna kichana.<verse eid="JOB 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21"/>“Xoossay asa hemethaa xeellees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">iya tango ubbaa wochees.<verse eid="JOB 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22"/>Iita ootheyisata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">genthanaw danda7iya sakana dhumi baawa.<verse eid="JOB 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23"/>Asay iya sinthe pirdas shiiqana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">Xoossay qaxaro immenna.<verse eid="JOB 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24"/>Oyshi bayna wolqaamata mentherethees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">enta bessan harata shuumees.<verse eid="JOB 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25"/>I enta oosuwa eriya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">enta issi qamman maatape wothidi dhaysees.<verse eid="JOB 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26"/>Enta iitatethaa gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">nagaranchota asa sinthan seerees.<verse eid="JOB 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27"/>Hessa I oothey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">enti iya kaallonna ixida gishonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">iya kiitaa aggida gishosa.<verse eid="JOB 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28"/>Enti manqota un7ethidi Xoossako waassana mela oothidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">Xoossay manqota waasuwa si7is.<verse eid="JOB 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29"/>Xoossay si77i giiko iya oone mootanay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">I ba som7uwa qosiko iya be7anay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">I asaapenne kawotethaafe bolla.<verse eid="JOB 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30"/>Hessi haniday geellay deriya haaronna melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">enta sinthan xihe wothonna melasa.<verse eid="JOB 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31"/>“Asi Xoossako yaagiyako Lo77o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">kase ta nagara oothidaba gidiko zaarada oothike.<verse eid="JOB 34:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32"/>Ta be7onnaysa tana tamaarsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">nagara oothidaba gidiko zaarada oothike.<verse eid="JOB 34:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33"/>Yaatin neeni paaxike gashe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">ne doseysa mela Xoossay new woytaneyee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Hiza qofa qachanay nenape attishin, tana gidike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">hessa gisho, ne ereysa taw oda.<verse eid="JOB 34:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34"/>Akeeka asay haysada yaagosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">cincati yaagosona;<verse eid="JOB 34:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35"/>‘Iyyobi eri bayna odetees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">Iya odan ayfey baawa.’<verse eid="JOB 34:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36"/>Iyyobi iita asada zaaro immida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">wursethi gakanaw paacetida gideerenne!<verse eid="JOB 34:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37"/>I ba nagaraa bolla geellatethi gujis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">nu sinthan Xoossaa bolla qelqisis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">Xoossa bolla daro odetis” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 34:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1"/>Elihuy qassi haysada yaagis;<verse eid="JOB 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2"/>“Iyyoba, neeni, ‘Taani Xoossaa sinthan xillo’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">geysi likee?<verse eid="JOB 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3"/>‘Taani nagaraa oothonna aggada ay go7etiyana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">ay wodhe demmanee?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">yaagada ne Xoossaa oychanaw danda7aasa.<verse eid="JOB 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4"/>Taani newunne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">ne laggetas zaaro immana.<verse eid="JOB 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5"/>Dhoqu gada salota xeella;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">neepe bollara de7iya shaara akeekada be7a.<verse eid="JOB 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6"/>Ne nagara oothiko Xoossaa aybin qohanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Ne balay dariko hessi iyaw ay oothii?<verse eid="JOB 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7"/>Ne xillo gidiko iyaw ay immanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">Woyko ne kushepe I ay ekanee?<verse eid="JOB 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8"/>Ne nagaraa oothiko ne mela ase qohaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">qassi xillikoka ase go77aasa.<verse eid="JOB 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9"/>“Un77i dariya wode asay waassees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">wolqaamata kushepe kessi ekiya asi koyidi wobbatoosona.<verse eid="JOB 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10"/>Shin oonika, ‘Qamma mazmure immiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">tana medhida Xoossay awun de7ii? <verse eid="JOB 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11"/>Do7atape aathidi tamaarseysi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">kafotape aathidi cinca ootheysi awun de7i’ yaagenna.<verse eid="JOB 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12"/>Enti waassoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">shin Xoossay enta otoruwa gaason,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">entaw zaaro immenna. <verse eid="JOB 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13"/>Coo waasuwa Xoossi tuma si7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossay hessa hayzenna.<verse eid="JOB 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14"/>Neeni ta Xoossaa be7anaw danda7ike yaagikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">ne mootoy iya sinthan de7iya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">ne iya danda7an naaganaw bessees.<verse eid="JOB 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15"/>Xoossay ase pirdonnabaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">nagara aggidi aadhana gada qopay?<verse eid="JOB 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16"/>Hessa gisho, neeni ne doona coo dooyasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">eri bayna haasaya darsaasa” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 35:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1"/>Elihuy gujidi haysada yaagis;<verse eid="JOB 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2"/>“Xoossaa doona gidada ta new odiyabay de7iya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">guuthu danda7ada si7a.<verse eid="JOB 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3"/>Taani ta eraa haaho soope ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">tana Medhidaysi xillo gideysa qoncisana.<verse eid="JOB 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4"/>Taani wordo haasayike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">kumetha eri de7iya asi neera de7eysa ammana.<verse eid="JOB 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5"/>“Xoossay tuma wolqaama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">shin I oonaka kadhenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">I ba akeekan mino.<verse eid="JOB 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6"/>I iitati de7on daana mela oothenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">shin un7etidaysatas suure pirdees.<verse eid="JOB 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7"/>Xoossay ba ayfiya xillota bollafe denthenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">enta kawotara utisidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">merinaw dhoqu dhoqu oothees.<verse eid="JOB 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8"/>Shin asay santhalaatan qashetiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">woyko meto wodoron oyketiko,<verse eid="JOB 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9"/>I enta oosuwanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:9">otoron oothida nagaraa enta bolla qoncisees.<verse eid="JOB 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10"/>Seera si7anaada enta haytha dooyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">nagarape simmana mela enta kiittees.<verse eid="JOB 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11"/>Enti si7idi iyaw kiitetiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">banta laytha saroninne ufaysan wursana.<verse eid="JOB 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12"/>Shin enti si7onna ixiko mashshan wurana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">enti era dhayida gisho hayqana.<verse eid="JOB 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13"/>“Xoossaa ammanonna asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">banta wozanan yilotida mela de7oosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">I enta pirdiya wode maade koyidi woossokona.<verse eid="JOB 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14"/>Enti oothiya tuna oosuwan dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">banta na7atethan hayqana.<verse eid="JOB 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15"/>Shin waayeteyisata enta waayiyape ashshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">enta metuwa baggara entaw odees.<verse eid="JOB 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16"/>“Xoossay nena meto wodorope,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">un7i bayna dalga bessi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">dooretida kathi kumida gaytaako kessana.<verse eid="JOB 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17"/>Shin ha77i iitata bolla gakiya pirday ne bolla gakin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">xillo pirdan oyketadasa.<verse eid="JOB 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18"/>Oonika nena duretethi bessidi cimmonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">wodhaafe daroy balethonna mela naageta.<verse eid="JOB 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19"/>Ne duretethay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">woyko ne dafetethay nena metope ashshanee?<verse eid="JOB 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20"/>Asay banta bessaafe dhayiya qammay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">yaana mela amottofa.<verse eid="JOB 36:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21"/>Ha meto ubbay nena gakiday hessa gaasona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">hessa gisho, iita oothonna mela naageta.<verse eid="JOB 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22"/>“Xoossay ba wolqan dhoqu dhoqu gis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">iya mela astamaarey oonee?<verse eid="JOB 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23"/>Xoossaa, ‘Haysa ootha’ gidi kiittey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">woyko, ‘Neeni iita ooso oothadasa’ yaaganaw danda7ey oonee?<verse eid="JOB 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24"/>Asay mazmuren sabbida iya oosuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">neka mazmuren sabba.<verse eid="JOB 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25"/>Asa koche ubbay Xoossaa oosuwa be7is;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">asay haahon eqidi xeellidosona.<verse eid="JOB 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26"/>Xoossay gita! Iya gitatetha nu akeekanaw danda7oko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">iya laytha darotethaas zawi baawa.<verse eid="JOB 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27"/>“Xoossay haathe abbafe pude salo efees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">duge zaaridi ira oothidi bukisees.<verse eid="JOB 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28"/>He iray shaarape keyidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">asa bolla bukana mela oothees.<verse eid="JOB 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29"/>Xoossi shaara waatidi micciyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">Xoossay de7iya saluwan waanidi guummiyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">oonika erenna.<verse eid="JOB 36:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30"/>I ba yuushon wol7antha poo7uwa laallees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">abba ciimmuwa waatidi kammiyako be7a.<verse eid="JOB 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31"/>Yaatidi Xoossay deriya aysees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">kathaa darsidi immees.<verse eid="JOB 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32"/>I wol7anthi ba kushen oykees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">ba mallida bessaa caddana mela kiittees.<verse eid="JOB 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33"/>Dadi dhuuqidi uushoy yaanaysa bessees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">meheyka uushoy yaanaysa erees.<verse eid="JOB 36:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1"/>“Iya uushuwan ta wozanay dirgees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">ba bessan qaaxees.<verse eid="JOB 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2"/>Iya doonape keyiya qaala si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">dadada guummiya iya girsaa hayzite.<verse eid="JOB 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3"/>I salo garsan ba wol7antha laallees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">biitta gaxape gaxa gakanaw kiittees.<verse eid="JOB 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4"/>Hessafe guye, iya guunthay si7etees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ba yashshiya girsaa sissees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">Iya girsay si7etiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ba wol7antha teqenna.<verse eid="JOB 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5"/>Xoossaa malaalsiya ogen ba guuntha sissees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">nuuni akeekanaw danda7onna gitaba I oothees.<verse eid="JOB 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6"/>I shachako, ‘Sa7an wodha’ yaagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">wolqaama iraako, ‘Buka’ yaagidi kiittees.<verse eid="JOB 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7"/>I medhida asa ubbay iya oosuwa erana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">asay banta oosuwa aggana mela oothees.<verse eid="JOB 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8"/>He wode do7ati banta bessaa geloosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">banta gongoluwan qosetoosona.<verse eid="JOB 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9"/>Wolqaama gotey dugehape dendees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">irxa carkoy pudehape yees.<verse eid="JOB 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10"/>Xoossaa de7o shempoy shachi medhees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">dalga haathata shuchada minthees.<verse eid="JOB 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11"/>Shaari haathe tookana mela oothees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">ba wol7antha shaara giddon laallees.<verse eid="JOB 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12"/>Shaarati iya kiitan biitta gaxaa yuuyosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">I kiittiya kiita ubbaa poloosona.<verse eid="JOB 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13"/>Xoossay ira bukisey biitta irxisanaasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">woyko asaa seeranaasa, woyko ba siiquwa bessanaasa.<verse eid="JOB 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14"/>“Iyyoba, hessa si7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">Xoossay oothiya malaalsiya oosuwa taki gada akeeka.<verse eid="JOB 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15"/>Xoossay shaarata waatidi kiittiyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">ba wol7antha waatidi wol7amisiyako eray?<verse eid="JOB 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16"/>Shaarati salon waanidi uttiyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">eran polo gidida Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">oothiya malaalsiya oosuwa neeni eray?<verse eid="JOB 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17"/>Dugeha carkoy carkidi biitta mishisiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">neeni wolqaama bazzo seelan til7ana.<verse eid="JOB 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18"/>Xoossay saluwa til7ida mastooteda micciya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">neeni iya maaddanaw danda7ay?<verse eid="JOB 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19"/>Nuuni era paca gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">Xoossas woygidi odetaneko ne nuna tamaarsa.<verse eid="JOB 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20"/>Xoossara odetana gada taani oychanaw koshshii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">tana dhaysana mela ta ayis iya denthethanee?<verse eid="JOB 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21"/>Carkoy salope shaara geeshshiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">salon phooliya awa oonika be7anaw danda7enna.<verse eid="JOB 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22"/>Pudeha baggara worqaa daaniya poo7oy bentees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">Xoossay yashshiya teeman qoncees.<verse eid="JOB 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23"/>Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaako shiiqanaw danda7oko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">iya wolqay gita.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:23">I ba tuma pirdaaninne ba gita xillotethan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">ase qohenna.<verse eid="JOB 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24"/>Hessa gisho, asay iyaw yayyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">bantana cinca geyisata I kadhees” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 37:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Zaaruwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1"/>Hessafe guye, Goday gote giddon gididi Iyyobas haysada yaagidi zaaris.<verse eid="JOB 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2"/>Eri bayna odan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">ta zoriya dhumisey I hessi oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3"/>Ane addeda danceta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">ta nena oychana, taw zaara.<verse eid="JOB 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4"/>Taani alamiya medhiya wode neeni awun de7ay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">Ane ne akeekiyako taw oda.<verse eid="JOB 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5"/>Ne eriko, ha sa7aa dalgatethaas zawa wothiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">Wadha wodoruwa sa7a bolla yeggiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6"/>Ha sa7aa tuussata kundonna mela minthidi oykiday aybee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">Ha sa7aa baasuwas koyro shuchaa wothiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7"/>Wonta bakalati issife yexiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">kiitanchoti ubbay ufaysan ilili giya wode ne eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8"/>Abba haathi biittafe dhuuqidi keyiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">iya pengeta gordiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9"/>Abbaa shaara mayzas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">sakana dhuman gooziday tana.<verse eid="JOB 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10"/>Abbay kanthonna mela zawa medhiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">iyaw pengenne teqe wothiday tana.<verse eid="JOB 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11"/>“Haysa gakanaw ya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">shin haysafe aadhofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">ne wolqaama hobbey hessan eqo” yaagiday tana.<verse eid="JOB 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12"/>Iyyoba, ne yeletoosope wonti wontana mela kiita eray,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">away dolana bessaa malla eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13"/>Wonta poo7oy biitta ubban poo7ana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">iita asata qosetida bessaafe qonce kessana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">neeni wonta kiitta eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14"/>Wonta poo7oy zumatanne zangaarata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">dakoydi wothida ma7oy eqidi benteysada bessees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">oto bolla wothida maatameda qoncees.<verse eid="JOB 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15"/>Iitata poo7oy eketana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">enta makalla qesey meqana.<verse eid="JOB 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16"/>Ciimmo abba giddo gelada pultuwa be7adii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">Woyko iya baasuwa gakada iya olla simeretadii?<verse eid="JOB 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17"/>New hayqo pengeti bentidona?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">Woyko sakana dhumaa pengeta be7adii?<verse eid="JOB 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18"/>Sa7ay ay mela giteeko ne eray?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">Hessa ubbaa ne eriya gidiko taw oda.<verse eid="JOB 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19"/>Poo7oko efiya ogey awunee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">dhumi awun de7iyako eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20"/>Poo7onne dhuma enta bessaa bessaa efanaw danda7ay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">Enti de7iya bessaa efiya ogiya eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21"/>Neeni sa7i medhetiya wode yeletida gishonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">daro laythi de7ida gisho hessa eronna aggaka!<verse eid="JOB 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22"/>Shachi minjetiya keethaa geladii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">woyko shachi dooretida bessaa be7adii?<verse eid="JOB 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23"/>Taani enta meto wodes, ola wodesinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">toora gallasas minja wothas.<verse eid="JOB 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24"/>Wol7anthi keya bessaa efiya ogey awun de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">Woyko doloha carkoy awupe keyidi carkii?<verse eid="JOB 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25"/>Iri wodhiya bessaa giigisiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">dadas oge kessiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26"/>Asi doonna mela biittan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">ira bukisey oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27"/>Melida mela biittay iran laakidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">purco maatay dolana mela oothiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28"/>Iras aawi de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:28">Woyko aka yeliday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29"/>Shachas aayiya de7ay?<verse eid="JOB 38:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30"/>Haathay shuchada minthees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">abba baasoy shachada uuketees.<verse eid="JOB 38:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31"/>Pilaadisa geetetiya xoolintota issife gathada qachanaw danda7ay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">Ooriyoona geetetiya xoolintoti qashetida wodoruwa billanaw danda7ay?<verse eid="JOB 38:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32"/>Cugan cugan de7iya xoolintota enta woden woden kessanaw danda7ay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">Biire geetetiya xoolintota enta naytara kaalethanaw danda7ay?<verse eid="JOB 38:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33"/>Saloti ay higgen aqiyako ne eray?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">He higgey sa7aa haarana mela oothanaw danda7ay?<verse eid="JOB 38:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34"/>Di7oy nena muukana mela ira bukisanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:34">ne qaala dhoqu oothada shaarata sissanaw danda7ay?<verse eid="JOB 38:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35"/>Wol7anthi kiittanaw danda7ay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">Enti neeko yidi, “Heko, ay oothino?” goonna?<verse eid="JOB 38:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36"/>Wozanas cincatethi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">kahas akeeka immiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37-38"/>Ba cincatethan shaarata taybanaw danda7ey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37-38">Baana munuqidi, urqa kessidi minthanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37-38">salo otota gedi oothidi haathe tiganaw danda7ey oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:37-38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39"/>Shankatada macca gaammos miyaba eha eray?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">koshatida gaammo marata muza eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40"/>Enti gongolon qoseti naagoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">bazzon zin7idi pee7osona.<verse eid="JOB 38:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41"/>Quuroti koshatidi daaburiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">enta nayti miyaba demmanaw taako waassiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">entaw miyaba immey oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1"/>“Woshi7ey awude yeliyako neeni eray?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">Baachoti bannakidi banta marata yeliya wode be7adii?<verse eid="JOB 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2"/>Enti ay mela ageena gam7iyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">awude yeliyako ne eray?<verse eid="JOB 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3"/>Enti gulbati eqetidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">banta marata yeley awudeko eray?<verse eid="JOB 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4"/>Enta marati bazzon diccidi minnoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">banta aayeta aggidi boosona; nam7antho guye simmokona.<verse eid="JOB 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5"/>“Wora hareti yeda daanada oothiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">Qashope enta birshidi yeddiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6"/>Entaw bazzuwa de7iya bessi oothada immas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">maxine biittan enti daanada oothas.<verse eid="JOB 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7"/>Katama waasuwape haakidi de7oosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">laaggeysta qodethi si7okona.<verse eid="JOB 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8"/>Enti dereta bolla bantana heemmoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">yan miya purco maata qoroosona.<verse eid="JOB 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9"/>“Menthi new oothanaw ero gandee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">Woyko ne zadalon qamma aqandee?<verse eid="JOB 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10"/>Goyana mela ne iya waaxanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">Woyko waaxada goyanaw danda7ay?<verse eid="JOB 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11"/>Neeni iya wolqaa minotethan ammanetanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">deexo ooso I oothana mela iyaw yegga agganee?<verse eid="JOB 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12"/>Neeni kathaa shaalen qolana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">woyko wudumman shiishana mela iya ammanay?<verse eid="JOB 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13"/>“Yanchoy ba qefiya ellesada qaathawusu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">shin haatha kafoda piradhanaw danda7uku.<verse eid="JOB 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14"/>Yanchoy ba phuuphulliya biittan phuuphulawusu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">shafen ho7ana mela aggaagawusu.<verse eid="JOB 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15"/>‘Tohoy menthana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">bazzo do7ati yedhana’ gada qopuku.<verse eid="JOB 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16"/>Nayti babaa gidonnaada oothada entaw daro iitawusu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">I daabura ubbay mela atteysi iw aykoka daanenna.<verse eid="JOB 39:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17"/>Hessada oothada iyo cincatethi diggidaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">akeeka dhaysiday tana.<verse eid="JOB 39:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18"/>Shin dendada iya woxiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">baara gaadetiya para bollanne paraawa bolla miiccawusu.<verse eid="JOB 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19"/>“Iyyoba, paratas wolqaa immiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">woyko parata morgen cimba mayziday nenee?<verse eid="JOB 39:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20"/>Parati booleda gupanaadanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">garmamidi daganthanaada oothiday nenee?<verse eid="JOB 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21"/>Parati banta wolqan ammanetidi dhiskoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">oletanaw ola demba gaallaboosona.<verse eid="JOB 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22"/>Yashshi erokona; enta aybika daganthenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">enta bolla mashsha shoddikoka guye simmokona.<verse eid="JOB 39:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23"/>Enta toggiya olanchoti oykida ola miisheti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">phoolishe issoy issuwara gahetidi giiroosona.<verse eid="JOB 39:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24"/>Shin parati biitta kaashishenne yashisishe gaallaboosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">Moyze girsi si7iya wode si77i gidi eqanaw danda7okona.<verse eid="JOB 39:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25"/>Moyzey punetiya wode ufaysan garmamoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">ola peeno haahon ekoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">toora mocona kiitaanne olanchota ceequwa si7oosona.<verse eid="JOB 39:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26"/>“Xiloy ba qefiya dugeha bagga miccidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">paallanaw danda7ey ne cincatethanee?<verse eid="JOB 39:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27"/>Arganthi pude keyidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">ba keethaa dhoqa dereta bolla keexey ne kiitanee?<verse eid="JOB 39:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28"/>Arganthi aafo doonan ba keethaa keexidi de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">zaalla qophoti iyaw qol7a gididosona.<verse eid="JOB 39:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29"/>Yan uttidi baw miyaba wochees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">iya ayfey haahon geeshshidi demmees.<verse eid="JOB 39:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30"/>Argantha nayti suuthi uyoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">gawuxi de7iya bessan shiiqoosona” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 39:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1"/>Goday Iyyobako zaaridi yaagis;<verse eid="JOB 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2"/>“Iyyoba, asi Ubbaa Danda7iya Godaara mootetidi, lathanaw danda7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Ane Xoossara mootetiya uray iyaw zaaro” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3"/>Hessafe guye, Iyyobi zaaridi, haysada yaagis;<verse eid="JOB 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4"/>“Godaw, taani pathonna laafa asi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">ta doona bolla kushe wothada si77i gaanape attishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">new ay zaaro immanaw danda7iyana?<verse eid="JOB 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5"/>Taani issi toho odas; shin taw zaariyabay baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">nam7antho odas haraa gujike” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6"/>Hessafe guye, Goday gote giddon giddon gididi Iyyobako haysada yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7"/>Addeda ne xeessaa dancada dendada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">ta oyshaas zaaro imma.<verse eid="JOB 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8"/>Ne tana bala asi kessana hanayee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">New xillo gidanaw tana wordancho kessayee?<verse eid="JOB 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9"/>Xoossa wolqaa mela wolqi new de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">Xoossay guummeysada ne guummanaw danda7ay?<verse eid="JOB 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10"/>Hessa gidiko, ne bonchuwanne gitatetha ma7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">ne wolqaanne teemuwa gixa.<verse eid="JOB 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11"/>Ne hanquwa gussa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">ane otoranchota xeellada kawusha.<verse eid="JOB 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12"/>Ane loytha xeellada otortiya ubbaa yeellaya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">iitata ubbaa enti de7iya bessaafe dhaysa.<verse eid="JOB 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13"/>Enta ubbaa biittan mooga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">duufon yeggada enta bolla gorda.<verse eid="JOB 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14"/>He wode ne wolqay nena ashshanaw danda7eysa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">ta markatana.<verse eid="JOB 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15"/>Taani nena medhidaada medhida Bihemoota geetetiya do7a be7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">I boorada maata mees.<verse eid="JOB 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16"/>Iya xeessan de7iya wolqaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">iya uluwa kammida shayaa minotethay daro.<verse eid="JOB 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17"/>Iya goynay zigada bollan qaaxees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">iya gedaa xaphoti minon dooqetidosona.<verse eid="JOB 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18"/>Iya meqethay naase birata mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">iya geday birata kure mela.<verse eid="JOB 40:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19"/>Xoossay medhida medheta ubbaa garsan I aadhees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">taape attishin, hari iya xoonanaw danda7ey baawa.<verse eid="JOB 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20"/>Do7i gupiya derey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">iyaw miyaba dolisees.<verse eid="JOB 40:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21"/>Mitha kuya garsan zin7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">caren maqa giddon qosetees.<verse eid="JOB 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22"/>Mithati banta kuyan iya genthoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">shaafa gaxan dicciya mithati iya kammoosona.<verse eid="JOB 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23"/>Shaafay kixidi goggey wode dagammenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">Yordaanose shaafay qoodhe gakanaw kumikoka I hirgenna.<verse eid="JOB 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24"/>Iya ayfiya toysidi, iya oykanaw danda7iya asi de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">Iya siidhiya lukidi oykanaw danda7ey oonee?<verse eid="JOB 40:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1"/>“Neeni Leewataane geetetiya abba do7aa manxaqon oykanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">woyko iya inxarsaa wodoron ancafanaw danda7ay?<verse eid="JOB 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2"/>Iya siidhiya lukada dafo aathanaw danda7ay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">Woyko iya gacuwa wospen lukanaw danda7ay?<verse eid="JOB 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3"/>I nena, ‘Hayyana tana aggarki’ yaagidi woossii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">Woyko new mal7o qaala odii?<verse eid="JOB 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4"/>Ne iya merinaw aylle oothada haarana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">I new ero gidi caaqanee?<verse eid="JOB 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5"/>Asi kafo loohiseysada ne iya loohisanaw danda7ay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">Woyko iya qachada ne macca naytara kaa7ana mela oothanee?<verse eid="JOB 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6"/>Molo zal7anchoti iya gatiya bolla palamona?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">Woyko iya qanxerethidi bayzoona?<verse eid="JOB 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7"/>Neeni iya galbaa tooran,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">woyko iya huuphiya mashshan caddanaw danda7ay?<verse eid="JOB 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8"/>Ane iya ne kushen bocha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">ne iyara butetida butiya dogaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">nam7antho iyara butetanaw qopaka.<verse eid="JOB 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9"/>He do7aa oykanaw paacey mela waaye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">hari attoshin iya be7ida ubbay yashshan kokorees.<verse eid="JOB 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10"/>I zin7ida bessaafe iya denthanaw oonika xaalenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">yaatin, ta sinthan eqanaw danda7ey oonee?<verse eid="JOB 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11"/>Taani iyaw zaarana mela koyro taw tal7iday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">Salope garsan de7iyaba ubbay tabaa.<verse eid="JOB 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12"/>“Taani Leewataane tohotaba, iya gita wolqaabanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">lo77iya iya asatethaba qoncisonna aggike.<verse eid="JOB 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13"/>Iya galbaa qaaranaw danda7ey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">Iya gacuwa pooqidi bixaala barsanay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14"/>Yashshiya achay de7iya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">iya gacuwa pooqanaw danda7ey oonee?<verse eid="JOB 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15"/>Iya zoko galbay issoy issuwa bolla dooretidi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">shuchada minnida gondalle daanees.<verse eid="JOB 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16"/>Enti issoy issuwas daro matatida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">enta giddora hari attoshin carkoy kanthanaw danda7enna.<verse eid="JOB 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17"/>Issoy issuwara gahetidi de7iya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">enta aybika shaakenna.<verse eid="JOB 41:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18"/>I hadhishiya wode poo7oy pol7u gees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">iya ayfeti wonta xalqeda caddees.<verse eid="JOB 41:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19"/>Iya doonape tama lacoy keyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">pinxiya tami bentees.<verse eid="JOB 41:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20"/>Iya siidhiyape cuyay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">tama bolla de7iya otope keya pento mela.<verse eid="JOB 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21"/>Iya siidhera keya shempoy kenchikelo bonqisees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">tama lacoy iya doonape keyees.<verse eid="JOB 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22"/>Iya morgiyan wolqay de7iya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">I daro yashshees.<verse eid="JOB 41:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23"/>Iya ashoy issife oyketidi de7iya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">iya asatethay biratada minnees.<verse eid="JOB 41:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24"/>Iya wozanay shuchada mino;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">gaacha woxa mela mino.<verse eid="JOB 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25"/>I dendiya wode minoti yayyoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">dagammidi baqatoosona.<verse eid="JOB 41:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26"/>Iya gakiya mashshay aykoka oothenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">toori woyko dongey woyko mashshi iya qohenna.<verse eid="JOB 41:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27"/>I birata xinqa maatada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">naase birata wooqida mithada mentherethees.<verse eid="JOB 41:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28"/>Dongey iya betisenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">yambarsha shuchi iyaw suulla mela.<verse eid="JOB 41:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29"/>Gumba xam7i iyaw xinqo mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">toora xongiya wode qelqisidi miicees.<verse eid="JOB 41:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30"/>Iya uluwa bolla de7iya galbay meqida kun7a mela qara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">urqara I biya wode marasha mela biitta phalqees.<verse eid="JOB 41:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31"/>Abbaa pentida haatha mela tumbul tumbul oothees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">xaaron pentiya zayte mela shiri shiri yeggees.<verse eid="JOB 41:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32"/>Iya biya ogey poo7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">abba haatha goponto laammees.<verse eid="JOB 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33"/>I yashshi eronna gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">biitta bolla iya mela medhetethi hari baawa.<verse eid="JOB 41:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34"/>I daro gita medhetethata ubbaa kadhees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">do7a ubbaas I kawo” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 41:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1"/>Hessafe guye, Iyyobi Godaako haysada yaagidi zaaris;<verse eid="JOB 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2"/>“Ne ubbaba oothanaw danda7eysanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">ne qofaa teqanaw danda7ey baynaysa taani eras.<verse eid="JOB 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3"/>Ne, ‘Eri bayna ta zoriya qosey oonee?’ yaagada tana oychadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">tuma taani taw geliboonnaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">ta eraape bolla gidida malaalsiyaba odetas.<verse eid="JOB 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4"/>“Neeni taako, ‘Taani odiya wode hayza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">taani oychiya wode zaara’ yaagadasa.<verse eid="JOB 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5"/>Taani kase nebaa haythan si7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">shin ha77i ta nena ayfen be7as.<verse eid="JOB 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6"/>Hessa gisho, ta odan yellatada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">bido bollanne baana bolla uttada paaxayis” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuusha Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7"/>Goday hessa Iyyobas odidaape guye, Temaanape yida Elfaazako haysada yaagis. “Ta aylliya Iyyobada hinte tabaa like odetiboonna gisho, ne bollanne ne nam7u laggeta bolla ta hanqoy eexis. <verse eid="JOB 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8"/>Hessa gisho, ha77i laapun kormatanne laapun marazeta ekidi ta aylliya Iyyobako bidi, xuussa yarsho hinte balas yarshite. Ta aylliya Iyyobi hintew woossana; taani iya woosa si7ada hinte hanuwa mela hintena seerike. Hinte ta aylliya Iyyobada tabaa like odibeketa” yaagis.<verse eid="JOB 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9"/>Hessafe guye, Temaanape yida Elfaazi, Shuuhape yida Beldadoosinne Na7imape yida Soofari bidi, Goday enta kiittidaysada oothidosona. Goday Iyyoba woosa s7is.<verse eid="JOB 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyobi Dako Woytetis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10"/>Iyyobi ba laggetas woossidaape guye, Goday iya zaaridi dureyis; iyaw kaseysa gisho nam7u kushe immis. <verse eid="JOB 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11"/>Hessafe guye, iya ishati, iya michetinne kase iya ereysati ubbay iyako yidi, iya son iyara gibira midosona. Iyaw azzanidosona; Goday iya bolla ehida meto ubban iya minthethidosona; qassi iyaw biranne worqa sagaayo immidosona.<verse eid="JOB 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12"/>Goday Iyyoba wursetha laytha koyro laythaafe aathidi anjis. Iyyobas tammanne oyddu mukulu dorsati, usupun mukulu gimaleti, issi mukulu waaxa booratinne issi mukulu macca hareti de7oosona. <verse eid="JOB 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13"/>Qassi iyaw laapun adde naytinne heedzu macca nayti yeletidosona. <verse eid="JOB 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14"/>Bayra macca na7iw Yimimo, nam7anthiw Qaxi7o, heedzanthiw Qerenhafuko yaagidi sunthis. <verse eid="JOB 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15"/>Iyyoba macca naytada mala lo77o macca na7i awu biittan bentibeenna. Enta aawa entaw enta ishatara laata biitta immis.<verse eid="JOB 42:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16"/>Hessafe simmin, Iyyobi xeetanne oytamu laythi de7is. Ba naytanne ba nayta nayta oyddantho yeletethaa gakanaw be7is. <verse eid="JOB 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17"/>Iyyobi daro wode de7idi, lo77o cima cimidi hayqis.<verse eid="JOB 42:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42"/>
</usx>
